<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Agele Kolidi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Folohe Kolidi Sesefea Sowi Agele Ewe Selefia Mebailu</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Kolidi</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Kld</para>
  <para style="rem">1st Draft with 4 translators and Johann in Walagu, November 2019; Joseph and Yobe and Johann in Ukarumpa in Feb, March 2020, and Sept 2020.</para>
  <para style="rem">September 2021. Advisor check of 1-14.32 with Wabele, Jack and Joseph in Ukarumpa. Anne present via Zoom. Yobe joined for last week.</para>
  <para style="rem">Village checking was done in 2 parts: Ch 1-11 in November 2021, ch 12-16 in April 2022.</para>
  <para style="rem">March 2022. Advisor check of 14.33-end with Jack Wasele, Joseph Hambowali and Felix Waibo</para>
  <para style="rem">Pre Consultant Check corrections for chapter 1-16 with Wabele Fuga and Diksen Wadaga in June 2022</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Kolidi</para>
  <para style="mt2">Folohe Kolidi Sesefea Sowi Agele Ewe Selefia Mebailu</para>
  <para style="imt">Sulu samini alegaeyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Folo alolu fogomo, Giligi hele Akaea fogoba asuluiya ami, Kolidi sidi bule ule ami ufulu. Kolidi sidi amimo, Folo enedale maugaba Yesune sulu mana walelu. Aufia, ehe sidi ami sese maugalu. Auluso, Folo e ili gadefia, dabalu nolobalo moloyone aafe fogomo, higinilu noolo Kolidi sese ami holobagalu. Aulune, Folohe asigilo nafulu mesia, ine higinilu amone isosia, sowi ewe seleba melu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kolidi idele inolone asigi ule ufulumo kiwi sanelosi, Folo ehe amone keleba hiliselu. Auba molosimo, ine mana nafulu mololo amo woba dafolosi. Dulu idele inolohe mana isolu koleba molomesi amone sulu solu. Aufia, e selesia, idele inolo aafemo Godene Asubane waagi uluba dibia simesi gadefasalenaga, amo higinilu holobagaloba solu. E selesiamo, gulugulusia mana nafulu mololo amoneda solu. Aufia, Asubane Noekenehe ulu kegele nonoba Keliso idele inolofea melo amoneda solu. Aufia, ehe inolo daneba yaalu haiba degeyobafe amoneda solu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kegele sunia Kolidifea higinilu melu amofealo, Folohe ili sagoba ofelesia, ilifea Godene hame amone sawaba walelu. Bugo ewene lalolu 13 amo, sigidubulu idele inolo helefealu sunia kakainabu amo bule hamesia alegalo. Lalolu ewemo, Folohe walesiamo, ulu kegele Godehe idele inolofea meba yaafe amo aleba ami, hameselo mana amo olaibo labeba walelu.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Separator Artwork for the Onobasulu NT - Waves" file="Separator1Onobasulu.tiff" size="span" loc="Between Book entry and text of the NT" copy="Johann Alberts, based on Onobasulu artwork" ref="1.0" /></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />Na <char style="w">Folo</char>, na <char style="w">Keliso</char> Yesune <char style="w" lemma="Hilibaisi daalu inolo">hilibaisi daalu</char> dabalu molomesi, Gode Ene hame alefasia, welune lolu. Nada, nine nelewo Sosodeneseda, anihe,<verse eid="1CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />Sowi ewe, Godene <char style="w">sese</char> idele inolo Kolidi sidi kakainabu gili amofea seleba mesu. Keliso Yesuhe gili <char style="w" lemma="Noekene">noekene</char> moloba ofelesia, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Edai muuba kalilu mosomu</char> melesi, gili iminiba ufulu. Aufia, idele inolo helefealu wagi kakainabu sunia, nine <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Yesu Kelisone wida digiba yaafe ili amo, gilidai ua auba melesi, iminiba ufulu. Amo Yesu E-mo, ine Saminilo ligia, nine Saminiloda labe.<verse eid="1CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />Nine Nao Godedai, Saminilo Yesu Kelisodaihe, gilifea kanuluba ofelesia, gine asigine libo esebalo gadaeaba melesi moloyobafe.<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folohe Godefea henelu sulu solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />Na gili hilisesia, na Godefea henelu sulu selabasu ado. Maumo, Yesu Kelisofea alefasia, Ehe Ene <char style="w">kanululo</char> gilifea melumohe, na auba sodo. <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />Kelisofea alefasia, Godehe kegele sunia gilifea liliba ufulu. Auba moloba ofelesimo, gine sulu sodo mana suniada, gine asigilo mana suniada, liliba ufulu dobu. <verse eid="1CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />Kelisone sulu, nini gilifea walelumo, gine libo usu diba dobune, gili kiwigaaba ofelefe. <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" />Aulugulu, gilihe nine Saminilo Yesu Keliso ulufaba holobagamesi, yasiba ligia, gilifea Asubane Noekenene ulu kegele ulenoda abobolu male alebaibu. <verse eid="1CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 3:13">1Des 3.13</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:23">5.23</ref></char></note>Yesu Kelisohe gili kiwigaaba ofolabia abia, helefealu ewe aleba elosia eloyobafe. Auba mololabia aasimo, Nine Saminilo Yesu Kelisone hilia amimo, gili heleba daaluda male babiyobafe. <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 1:3">1Yon 1.3</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:24">1Des 5.24</ref></char></note>Gode E seale molologulu, E solu amo sunia moloba samodoyobafe. Aufia, Gode Ehe gilimo Ene Faibedai dafifia melesi welu. Ene Faibe amo, nine Saminilo Yesu Keliso labe.<verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sese haisi haisiba osolaba dafalilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PHP 2:2">Fil 2.2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ne damenedali, nine Saminilo Yesu Kelisone wi alefasia, na gilifea kiwigaaba eweguba selesu. Gili sulu selefea ogo, hilise ule ofasia saamale. Gili koleba osolaba dafalimabiyo. Aufia, gili koleba mosomu ule ligia, asigi ule, hilise ule koleba melale. <verse eid="1CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />Ne damenedali, na eweguba selesi dubulu. Koloe moloa kakainabu noolo amohe nafea selesia, gili gine geleba hegeba yaaluba solumo, na dubulu. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:4">1Kld 3.4</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 18:24-28">HD 18.24-28</ref></char></note>Sulu na dubulumo ewe. Gili aleba noolo selesia, “Na <char style="w">Folo</char> kuliba aasu”. Noolo selesia, “Na Aboloso kuliba aasu”. Noolo selesia, “Na <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Sifase</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sifaseba selefemo, Fidane wi no selefe. (Yone 1.42 ami bamale.) Sulu <char style="it">sifase</char>mo, Hibulu suluba abane-sia sodo. Sulu <char style="it">fida</char>mo, Giligi suluba abane-sia sodo.</char></note> kuliba aasu”. Aufia, noolo haiba selesia, “Na Keliso kuliba aasuba” selaba labe.<verse eid="1CO 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />Halagubane selese? Keliso E haisi haisiba osolabubile? Folo nahe, gili sagoba ofelesia, <char style="w">imolane</char> olalubile? Gili <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano gesiamo</char>, Folone wi alefasia hano gelubile? Auba auluale. <verse eid="1CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:8">HD 18.8</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 16:23">Lom 16.23</ref></char></note>Gili aleba ugi, nahe Kisifusudai, Gaiyusudai, aalusu hano gelu. Na inolo no hano geba ufuluale. Amonemo, na Godefea henelu sulu selesu. <verse eid="1CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15" />Aulugulu, inolo nohe, na Folone wi alefasia hano geluba saeyodoluale. <verse eid="1CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:15">1Kld 16.15</ref></char></note>Ee, seale koleba, na Sedefanaseda, ene dameneda, ili amoda na hano geba waalelu. Auluso, amone faisalo, inolo ulenoda na hano gelumo, male kolebabuba hilisesu. <verse eid="1CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" />Maumo, Kelisohe na hilibailumo, idele inolo hano geba waalemesine auluale. Aubale. E na hilibailumo, awalu sulu nafulu samesi aulu. Na sulu mana selesiamo, mesegeba dawalolo inolo sodoguba sodale. Na auba mesegeba selesiabiaga, nene kiwi alefasia, sulu mana sabaiyo. Ausiabiaga, amo nahe Kelisone <char style="w">imolane</char> amomo kiwida malesia, auba sabaiyo.<verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Keliso E Godene kiwi labe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 1:16">Lom 1.16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulune, idele inolo afiyo labe ili hilisesiamo, <char style="w" lemma="Imolane">imolanene</char> sulu ewemo kagoasia selaba labeba hilisefe. Auluso, idele inolo <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba obegeba dulu</char> nini amo asigisiamo, imolanene sulu amohe Godene kiwi ulufaba walefeba asigibu. <verse eid="1CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:14">Ais 29.14</ref></char></note>Godene bugohe eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1CO 1:19" />
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">
    <char style="qt">Dawalolu inolone dawalolomo, Nahe diba dafiyobasu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, asigida inolone asigi nafulumo, Nahe eleda male moloba ufiyobasu.</char><verse eid="1CO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 19:12">Ais 19.12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 33:18">33.18</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 44:25">44.25</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 12:17">Jop 12.17</ref></char>
    </note>Aulugulu, dawalolu inolone dawalolomo, ele hala? <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">Mosesene sulu mugulida walelo inolo</char>, ine sulumo, ele hala? Aufia, asigi belebeleba sulu sodo inolo aga sibaisafe ewe, ine asigilomo, ele hala? Godehe helefealu idele inolone dawalolo amo kagoaba ofelesia, eleda male gadefafia labe. <verse eid="1CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:25">Mad 11.25</ref></char></note>Helefealu idele inolo ine dawalolo amo alefasia, Godemo nafuluba fadaba asigiba dilale. Auluso, Gode Ene dawalolo amohe, idele inolo gasiba dafelagoyone eno no madeneba ufulu. Ninihe eno amone idele inolofea waleba lolu. Sulu nini auba waleba labemo, helefealu idele inolo ilihe, kagoalu sulu eleda maleba asigife. Auluso, Gode E-mo amone henefe.<verse eid="1CO 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" />
    <char style="w">Yuda</char> ilimo, eloba babiyone momolelu nokene nokeneba molofe amosu babiyo hamelobiyo. Aufia, Giligi ilimo, asigilo nafuludai, dawalolo nafuludai, amosu isalobiyo. <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:32">Lom 9.32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 2:14">1Kld 2.14</ref></char></note>Auluso, ninihe, Yesu Keliso <char style="w">imolane</char> olalu amone saaba melo. Yuda idele inolo ilihe, sulu amone dobelesiamo, habosia waaselaba bolo. Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau idele inolo</char> ili hilisesiamo, sulu amo kagoalu eleda maleba asigilo. <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:3">Kol 2.3</ref></char></note>Auluso, Godehe iminifia weba yaalu idele inolo ninimo, nini Yudada, Giligida, nini hilisesiamo, Keliso E Godene kiwi ligia, E-mo, Godene dawalolo amone mau labeba asigilo. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 13:4">2Kld 13.4</ref></char></note>Helefealu idele inolomo, ili hilisesia, Godene dawalolo amo eleda male ligia kagoaluba hiliselo. Auluso, Godene kagoalu manaba sodo amohe, helefealu idele inolone dawalolo dulu amo sunialu dobu. Aufia, helefealu idele inolo ilihe Gode mololumo kiwidaleba asigilo. Auluso, Godene kiwi saneluba sodo amohe, helefealu idele inolone kiwigagalumo wasolu dobu.<verse eid="1CO 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 11:25">Mad 11.25</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:5">Yem 2.5</ref></char>
    </note>Ne nelewodalida, ne nanodalida, Godehe gili weiya fogo amo, nafuluba hiliseba obegema. Fogo ami, gili aleba ami, helefealu idele inolone si saabia, dawalolu idele inolo wedinale aloluale. Aubale. Gili wedinalemo weagulu ligia, noolo uluba adale alolu. Aufia, gili wedinalemo, wida solu amone damenefeafia aloluale. <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />Auluso, Godehe helefealu iwimo, dawalolu labe amone yuaba ufiyonemo, helefealu idele inolone si saabiamo, idele inolo kagoalu labe amone molobebelelo. Godehe helefealu iwimo, uluba ado kiwida amone yuaba ufiyonemo, helefealu idele inolo kiwidale amone molobebelefia gadefalo. <verse eid="1CO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />Helefealu iwi wida male idele inoloda, weagulu idele inolo amoda, idele inolo noolohe waaselaba besabe amoda, ili amone Godehe molobebelefia welo. Auba molosiamo, Godehe wida ado manamo, weagulu kegele eleda maleba moloba ofolo. <verse eid="1CO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:9">Efe 2.9</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, inolo uleno Godene si saabia ene wi bamabamaba saeyone dabalu male koleba. <verse eid="1CO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:5-6">Jer 23.5-6</ref></char></note>Maumo, Gode Ene alefasia, ninimo Keliso Yesufea kulifia gadefalu dobu. Aufia, E alefasia, Kelisomo, nine dawalolo amone maumo, E labe. Aufia, Keliso Efeasu alefasia, Godehe nini isolu idele inolo holobagamesi moloba ufulu. Aufia, Ehe ninimo difasia, Edai <char style="w">muuba kalilu</char> melesi moloba ofolabia daabasu melesi gadefabu. Aufia, Keliso E dabalu mololu amo alefasia, nini sububa dafogolune, woluhe nini saabia no uluba ligia yasibuale. <verse eid="1CO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:24">Jer 9.24</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, ninihe mana Godene bugo selelu dobuguba moloyoba.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1CO 1:31" />
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:31">
    <char style="qt">“Ga ge wi henesia kaiiyo hilisemabiyo.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:31">
    <char style="qt">Aubale, Saminilone wi amosu henesia kaiiba digimale.”</char><verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="s">Folohe Gode sulu mana walesiamo, dawalolu inolo mesegeba waleloguba waleluale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />Ne nelewodalida, ne nanodalida, na gili labea milifasia alolu fogomo, Godene sulu mugusilu amone ulufaba walesiamo, nahe dawalolu inolo mesegeba waleloguba waleluale. Aubale. <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" />Maumo, na gilidai ligiamo, na kegele noolo asigiyoba hiliseluale. Aubale. Na Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisosu</char> asigiba alolu. Ee, Yesu Keliso E <char style="w">imolane</char> olalu amonesu asigiyo hiliseba alolu. <verse eid="1CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:9">HD 18.9</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 10:1">2Kld 10.1</ref></char></note>Aufia, na gili labea inigiamo, na kiwida male adesia, kiwi bibilisia, sagili bule koleba alolu. <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 1:5">1Des 1.5</ref></char></note>Na gili labea Godene sulu mana waleba ligiamo, sulu na walelu amo, dawaloloda dulu mesegeba waleloguba na waleluale. Aubale. <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenene</char> kiwigagalu amone gilifea ulufaba fadaba waleba alolu. <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" />Na gilifea eweguba waleba alolu amone maumo, ewe. Gili <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelesiamo</char>, helefealu inolone dawalolo walefe amone sigiba dobolosi, na auba aulu. Auluso, gilimo Gode Ene kiwigagalu amofea alefasiasu, asigi ule homesi hamesia, na auba aulu.<verse eid="1CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Godene Asubanehe ninifea dawalolo nafulu melo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />Seale, asigi ule ufulufealomo asidalu alebaibu ilifeamo, ninihe dawalolo sulu walelo. Auluso, dawalolo amo, helefealu inolo aga alebaibu ewefea alefasia, duluale. Helefealuda uluba ligia yasifia alebaibu ili amofea alefasiada, duluale. Inolo ili amone kiwigagalumo, eleda male adoguba asigileyone daaba labe. <verse eid="1CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />Auluso, ninihe Godene dawalolo sulu nafulu amo, fadaba ulufaba waleba lolu. Godehe helefealu ewe aso molobale ligiamo, ninida Ene <char style="w">elalelu</char> nafulu amone difasia, Edai helegeba mesesifia, asigi daiyaba ufulu. Auluso, Godene dawalolo amo mugusilu ufulubiyo. <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />Ausi, helefealuda uluba ligia yasifia alebaibu inolo suniahe, amo fadaba asigiluale. Aubale. Ili asigilubiaga, elalelune <char style="w">Saminilo</char> amo <char style="w">imolane</char> uluba ofaiyale. <verse eid="1CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 64:4">Ais 64.4</ref></char></note>Godene bugohe selelu dobumo ewe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1CO 2:9" />
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">
    <char style="qt">Kegele inolo si bolale amoda,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">
    <char style="qt">inolo koneni dobolale amoda,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">
    <char style="qt">aufia helefealu inolone asigi asigilale amoda,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">
    <char style="qt">kegele amo, Godehe idele inolo Efea hamesefe ili amoneba madeneba dobu.</char><verse eid="1CO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />Samini, Godehe madeneba ufulu amo muguba ufuluso, aga Ene Asubane alefasia, Ehe kegele amo ninifea ulufaba walefia labe. <char style="w">Asubane Noekene</char> E-mo, kegele sunia nafuluba fadaba asigiba disia, Gode ene asigi usulaboba sugalu dobu amoda, E fadaba asigilu labe. <verse eid="1CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />Inolone asigi usu dobu amo, inolo no asigibualeso, inolo amo ene asubanesu asigibu. Auba mololo amogubasu, inolo ulenohe Godene asigimo aubada asigibuale. Gode Ene Asubane amo E-su asigibu. <verse eid="1CO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" />Ninihe helefealu ewene asubane duluale. Aubale. Gode alefasia, kegele ninifea ulu melu amone fadaba asigimesimo, ninihe Asubane Godefeafia saabe amone dulu.<verse eid="1CO 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />Ninihe ulu kegele melu ewene selesiamo, helefealu inolone dawalolo amone difasia sodale. Aubale. Asubane Noekenehe ninifea walesi, nini sodo. Ausiamo, Asubanefealo kegele selesiamo, Asubanene dawalolo amone difasia, sulu sodo. <verse eid="1CO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" />Inolo abehe Godene Asubane efea labalenaga, Godene Asubanene ulu kegele nafulu saabe amo, e difale. Inolo amoguluhe, ulu kegele amo eleda maleba hilisesia, amone fadaba asigiba diaba yaeyobafale. Enebamo, Asubaneda labe e-su fadaba asigiba diyobafe. <verse eid="1CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" />Godene Asubaneda labe ehe, kegele sunia nafuluba osolasia, fadaba asigiyobafe. Auluso, ulenohe inolo amo koleba osolasia, fadaba babiyobafale. <verse eid="1CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:13">Ais 40.13</ref></char></note>Maumo, Godene bugohe eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1CO 2:16" />
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:16">
    <char style="qt">Saminilone asigimo fadaba diyone, inolo uleno male koleba.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:16">
    <char style="qt">Saminilofea waleyone, inolo uleno male koleba.</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="1CO 2:16" />
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 2:16">Auluso, Kelisone asigimo ninifea dobu.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="s">Sesene dabalu mololo inolomo, Godene dabalu mololo inolo alebaibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />Auluso, ne nelewodalida, ne nanodalida, na gilidai sigiamo, idele inolo Asubaneda labefea walelo amogubamo, gilifea auba waleluale. Aubale. Idele inolo helefealu manada aso kuliba dedaleba labefea walelo amoguba, walelu. Enebamo, Kelisofea asigi ule ufulufealomo, gili aso faibe subobogulu alebaibu. <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 5:12-13">Hib 5.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:2">1Fid 2.2</ref></char></note>Gilimo, naiyo kolelu aso naiyodoluale baafia, nahe gilifea bu hanosu koleba melu. Seale auba aulugulu, aga gilimo, naiyo kolelu naiyomo, aso naiyodoluale alebaibu. <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:10-11">1Kld 1.10-11</ref></char></note>Maumo, gili aso helefealune mana kuliba dedaleba labe. Gilimo, gine geleba babiyo habosia, suluhe gine geleba hegeba labe. Mana amohe, gili helefealune mana aso kuliba aafeba walesia aufe. Gilimo, helefealu idele inolo mololo amoguba moloba labe. <verse eid="1CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:12">1Kld 1.12</ref></char></note>Maumo, gili aleba ugi, inolo uleno selesia, “Na <char style="w">Folo</char> kuliba aasu.” Aufia no selesia, “Na Aboloso kuliba aasu.” Auba selefe amohe, gili aso helefealune inolo alebaibu.<verse eid="1CO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:4">HD 18.4</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 18:11">11</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 18:27-28">27-28</ref></char>
    </note>Gili nafuluba asigima. Aboloso e abe? Aufia, Folo e abe? Animo, Godene dabalu mololo inolo lolu. Ani Ene dabalu auba moloba labimo, gili Kelisofea ami <char style="w">asigi ule ofeleso</char>. <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilohe</char> Abolosofeamo dabalu no mesia, aufia nafeamo dabalu no melune, ani dabalu amone moloba alolu. <verse eid="1CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" />Na edo gelo. Aufia, Aboloso e-mo, edo geiya hano sagalo. Auluso, Gode Ene Ehe edo gelu soboba ofolo. <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />Aulugulu, edo gelo inolo amoda, hano sagalo inolo amoda, aine wimo saeyobafale. Auluso, Gode, edo geluda sobomesi moloba ofolo amo, E-su wida labe. <verse eid="1CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:27">Mad 16.27</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:20-22">Efe 2.20-22</ref></char></note>Inolo edo gefe amoda, aufia inolo hano sagafe amoda, aalu mau ule alefasia, ua dabalu molofe. Aufia, aalu elebi elebibahe, aine hogololu dabalu mololu amoguba elebe diyobafe. <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" />Amogubasu, Aboloso animo, Godene dabalu ule mololo lolu. Ausi, gilimo Ene edo gelu labe.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="1CO 3:9">Sesene dabalu mololo inolomo moloda dilo amone alebaibu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 3:9">Gilimo, Gode Ene molo dulu labe. <verse eid="1CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />Godehe nafea kanulufia asigilo melugulu, na moloda dilo dawalolo dulu amo holobagasia, molo amone ikau koleba gegelu. Aufia, ikau na gegelu amone saabia amimo, inolo nohe molo diabia felalo. Aulune, inolo sunia ili molo disiamo, nafuluba koleba diyo dobu. <verse eid="1CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Ais 28.16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:10">Mag 12.10</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 4:11">HD 4.11</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:20">Efe 2.20</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:33">Lom 9.33</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:6-8">1Fid 2.6-8</ref></char></note>Ikau kolelu geba dobu amomo, Yesu <char style="w">Keliso</char> E labe. Aulune, ikau gelu amo dugufasia, haiba alibiaba hagaea no geyomo, male koleba.<verse eid="1CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12" />Aulugulu, inolo noolohe molo disiamo, ikau kolelu geba ufulu saabia ami disiamo, kegele nafulusu molafasia, dilo. Kegele nafulu amomo, <char style="w" lemma="Golo">goloda</char>, silifada, abane nenafoloda, amoguluhe dilo. Auluso noolomo, ihe molo dife. Noolomo, gabaiyahe dife. Aufia noolomo, ofa agohe dife. <verse eid="1CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:5">1Kld 4.5</ref></char></note>Godene iminiba ufulu hilia amo adesimo, idele inolo molo halagulu dululaba, amone babiyone ulufaba yane dibia holobagaeyobafe. Maumo, hilia amimo, dehe dedeba bisigia, dabalu amenegulu mololulaba dedeba babiyobafe. <verse eid="1CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />Dehe dedeba bisigia, molo dulu amo de naasalenaga, amo moloda dulu ili amo elebe diyobafe. <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />Auluso, molo dulu amo naba samodosenaga, amo moloda dulu inolo ene dabalu mololu amo sunia hodobaisaeyobafe. Auluso, ene e-mo, hodobaiyobafale. Aubale. E siba dafiyobafeso, e-mo de waiyafeafia obegeba dulu inolo amogulu miliyobafe.<verse eid="1CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gilimo Godene sebele molo labe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 6:19">1Kld 6.19</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 6:16">2Kld 6.16</ref></char>
    </note>Sulu ewe nafuluba asigima. Gilimo sunia Godene <char style="w">sebele molo</char> labe. <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Godene Asubanemo</char>, gine libo usu ami saabe. <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />Uleno abehe, Gode Ene sebele molo amo woba dafelesenaga, Godehe inolo amo eda sabe woba dafiyobafe. Maumo, sebele molo amomo, Gode Ene ligia, <char style="w">muuba kalilu</char> labe koleba. Gili sunia ua, molo amo koleba labe.<verse eid="1CO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ninihe inolone wi digimabiyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />Gili aleba ami, uleno, helefealu idele inolone si saabiamo, “Na dawalolu loluba” hilisesenaga, gili gine meleba gegesia, heleba asigimabiyo. Helefealu idele inolone si saabiamo, gili inolo kagoalu amogulu melale. Auba ausimo, gili Godene si saabiamo dawalolu idele inolomo ami miliyobafe. <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:13">Jop 5.13</ref></char></note>Maumo, helefealu ewene dawalolo bule dulu amomo, Godene si saabiamo, koagelugulu besabe. Godene bugo eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1CO 3:19" />
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 3:19">
    <char style="qt">“Godehe helefealu dawalolu inolo ili amone yogoleba daafa gegelo mana amo difasia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 3:19">
    <char style="qt">ine ili seyone kani heleba ufulu dobu.”</char><verse eid="1CO 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 94:11">Sng 94.11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, Godene bugohe eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1CO 3:20" />
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 3:20">
    <char style="qt">“Helefealu iwimo, dawalolu idele inolo ilihe moloyoba hilisefe amomo,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 3:20">
    <char style="qt">Saminilo Ehe ine asigimo nafuluba fadaba bisigiamo, ele heleyobafaleba bolo.”</char><verse eid="1CO 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21" />Aulugulu, helefealu inolo wida labe amone kuliba abia, gine wi henesia kaiimabiyo. Aubale. Kegele sunia gine dobu. <verse eid="1CO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22" /><char style="w">Folo</char> nada, Abolosoda, aufia <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Sifaseda</char>, aufia helefealu ewela, me miliyolula, me olaeyola, me kegele aga dobu ewela, aufia kegele dufia holobagaeyobafe amola, amo sunia gine. <verse eid="1CO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />Aufia, gili suniamo, Kelisone labe. Aufia Keliso E-mo, Godene labe.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Hilibaisi daalu inolo ine mana sealemo ewe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />Aulugulu, gili asigisiamo, ninimo <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisone</char> dabalu mololo inolo labebuba asigimale. Aufia, Godene sulu samini mugusilu muguba ufulu amone, ulufaba walemesi, nini gadefalu lolu. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:42">Lug 12.42</ref></char></note>Ausi, inolo uleno dabalu molomesi gadefalu labenaga, amo ehe, eda dabalu molomesi gadefalu amone sulu nafuluba kuliba abia, ene dabalu fedoba sefia, moloba samodoyo dobu. <verse eid="1CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />Gilihe Folo e dabalu isoba molofebilesia, na osolasenaga, amone na wedinoda keleba hiliseale. Aufia, noolo fadaasiamo, mana na mololumo osolasenagada, amoneda na keleba hiliseale. Seale koleba, nahe nene mana amoda nene meleba osolalale. <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />Seale koleba, nenemo, na wolu mololuba asigifale. Auluso, na auba asigife amohe, na isolu inolo lolububa auba walefale. Aubale. Nada osolafe amo, <char style="w">Saminilo</char> amo E. <verse eid="1CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:8">1Kld 3.8</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, Godehe iminiba ufulu hilia amo aso holobagabale labimo, gilihe inolo none manamo osolamabiyo. Gili koleba, Saminilo miyo hilia amone yasifia melale. Ehe yane dia saabimo, kegele sunia nigili gagaiya muguba dobumo, ulufaba ufiyobafe. Aufia, idele inolo ine asigine libo hame muguba dobumo, Ehe ulufaba ufiyobafe. Ausi, fogo amoyamo, Godehe ninifea dabalu elebi elebiba mololu amone, ga nafulu mololusia, elebe meyobafe.<verse eid="1CO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kolidi ilihe bamabamasia elelilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 12:3">Lom 12.3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ne damenedali, aga gine asigi ogone sagoba ufiyone, sulu na selesiamo, nahe Abolosofeada, nene nafeada, iminiba selesu. Ani dedeba mololu ewene baafia, gilihe Godene bugo selelu dobuguba kuliba abia, sulu selelu dobu ewemo felagifia malabiyo. Aulugulu, gili bamabamaba elelisia, inolo none wi digisia, none wi dufa dafogoba samabiyo. <verse eid="1CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:6">Lom 12.6</ref></char></note>Damene, abehe ga wida inolo gadefaso? Kegele sunia ga dobu amo, ga Godene sonefeafia dulu. Auba dulugulu, enesi, ga kegele sunia ne kiwi alefasiasu dulusia, bamabamase?<verse eid="1CO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />Wae! Gili ama kegele nafulu diaba yaalu dobubu! Wae! Gili ama elebeda ufulu alebaibubu! Wae! Gili nini wasefasia, kinigulu adesia, kegele sunia uluba ligia yasiyo maugalubu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Folo sulu ewe Kolidi ilifea selesiamo, kakamaleba selefe.</char></note> Yeele! Gili seale kini alolubiaga, na hamebaiyo. Enebamo, auba ausiabiaga, ninida gilidai ua kini alebaiyo. <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" />Auluso, aga, <char style="w" lemma="Hilibaisi daalu inolo">hilibaisi daalu</char> ninimo, kinigulu helegeba loluale. Aubale. Godehe ninimo haisa gadefalu koleba labebuba hilisesu. Ninimo, ilihe fadaasia, dufa olamaleba solu amogulu adefe. Nini yuaba ofelesia, helefealu idele inolo suniada, <char style="w">Godene sulu dia ano</char> ili suniada, sidafia labi, nini dufa olaeyogulu adefe.<verse eid="1CO 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />Kelisofea alefasiamo, nini kagoalu inolo lolu.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CO 4:10">Auluso, gilisumo, Keliso dawalolo inolo labebu.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1CO 4:10">Nini kiwidale loluso,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CO 4:10">gilimo kiwida alebaibubu.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1CO 4:10">Nini widale loluso,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CO 4:10">gilimo wida labe kolebabu.<verse eid="1CO 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 11:23-27">2Kld 11.23-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Seale, saminifia adabia mulia amimo, nini mamialo.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1CO 4:11">Aufia, ninimo hano nabaiyelo.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1CO 4:11">Aufia, ninimo fagulo bibidiba yaalu amone kakalo.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1CO 4:11">Ilihe ninimo wobasubale dufulo.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1CO 4:11">Aufia, ninimo moloda malene, sobelegulu sibaisalo.<verse eid="1CO 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2TH 3:8">2Des 3.8</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:44">Mad 5.44</ref></char>
    </note>Ninimo, nine sonehe hogololu dabalu mololo.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1CO 4:12">Ilihe ninifea woba selesimo,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CO 4:12">ninihe ilimo <char style="w" lemma="Edililo - Ediliba Ofolo">ediliba ofolo</char>.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1CO 4:12">Ilihe ninifea naga mesimo,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CO 4:12">nine mofe saufia, higinilu amo diaba ado.<verse eid="1CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />Aufia, idele inolo noolo nini saaba dudusimo,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CO 4:13">ninihe ilifeamo sulu nafulusu sodo.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1CO 4:13">Saminifia adabia mulia amifia aga iwimo, idele inolo suniane si saabiamo, sesenelu wolu saidafulugulu adesia, nini eleda malegulu ado.<verse eid="1CO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folohe Kolidi idele inolofea enao sodoguba solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />Nahe sowi ewe gili yuamesine seleba mebaisuale. Aubale. Gilimo ne faibe nene hameselu koleba labene, na sulu ewe gilifea hagugulu sulu seleba mebaisu. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:19">Gal 4.19</ref></char></note>Yesu Kelisofea asigi ule ufulufealomo, gili uluba miliyo inolomo saludiale adesenagada, amo gine gaomo ulusesu labe. Gine gao ule amo, na lolu. Maumo, nahe awalu sulu nafulu gilifea maugaba walesi, gilimo ne faibe holobagabu. <verse eid="1CO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 3:17">Fil 3.17</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, na gine gao ligia, gilifea kiwigaaba selesia, na mana molologubasu kuliba abia, gili na mimisililu melale. <verse eid="1CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:22">HD 19.22</ref></char></note>Gili auba moloba melesimo, nahe <char style="w" lemma="Dimodi">Dimodi</char> gili labea hilibaisu ogo. E-mo ne faibegulu, na e hamesebu. Ehe Saminilone dabalu nafuluba koleba uluba ado. E alefasia, gine asigi ogohe na Keliso Yesudai ligia mololoba haiba asigiba obegemesi degeba ufiyobafe. Mana amomo, nahe hele sunia, idele inolo <char style="w">sese</char> sunia kakainabufea kuliba malesi walelo.<verse eid="1CO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />Gili aleba noolo hilisesia, na gili labea miyobafalesia, bamabamasia waalefe. <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />Auluso, Saminilohe nafea fogo mesenaga, amo na gili labea alebale miyo. Aufia, na miyomo, bamabamasia selefe inolo ine sulu dubiyone miyale. Aubale. Na miyomo, ili amo amenene kiwigagalu sefia labelaba dedeba babiyone miyo. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 2:4">1Kld 2.4</ref></char></note>Maumo ewe, Gode Saminilo Ligia Yasiba ada amo, sulu saeyo amoneale. Aubale. Gode Ene Yasifia ada amo, Ene kiwigagalu amone labe. <verse eid="1CO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />Aulugulu, Na gili labea saabimo, na gilifea eneba molomesi hamefe? Gili ami isomesine, nahe buluso gelelu sefia milesi hamefela? Me, na gili hamesefia ligia, onafia milesi hamefela?<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="s">Wolu mana gine sese usu ami dobumo diba damale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />Gine sese aleba ugi, susugu mana wolu koleba holobagafeba selesi dubulu. Susugu mana amogulumo, <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau idele inolo</char> ilihe aubada mololale. Amo ewe. Inolo ulenohe ene enaone eamono no amodai haneba labeba seleso. <verse eid="1CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />Auba ausi, gili aso gine meleba bamabamaba alebaibu ogo, enesi ause? Gilihe gine meleba yuafia yegilisiabiaga, amo nafulubaiye. Aufia, woluda moloba labe inolo amo, gine sese usu ami adesiale, yau gadefasiabiaga, amoda nafulubaiye.<verse eid="1CO 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 2:5">Kol 2.5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Seale, domalafealomo, na gilidai aso loluale. Auluso, ne asubanemo gilidai lolu. Aulugulu, na auba gilidai sigia, inolo auba molofe amone manamo, na fadaba baafia, osolafia saaba dobu. <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" />Aulune, gili nine <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Yesune wi alefasia gagaiyosimo, ne asubaneda, Saminilo Yesu Ene kiwigagaluda, gili labea miliyobafe. <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 1:20">1Dim 1.20</ref></char></note>Nini auba gagaiyosiamo, ninihe inolo amomo <char style="w" lemma="Sedene">Sedenene</char> sone libo melesi waagi gadefamale. Ausenaga, ene helefealune libomo woba dafiyofealo maiyobafe. Auluso, ene asubanemo, Saminilone hilia adesimo, Godehe e gasiba dafelagosia obegeba diyobafe.<verse eid="1CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 5:9">Gal 5.9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Inolo amo gine sese usu aleba ugi aso labegulu, gilihe gine meleba kaiisia, gine wi digife mana amo, nafuluale. Gili ewe hilisebualela? <char style="w">Yisi</char> wedinohe, boledi sunia bulelo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yisi wedino </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amo, besi sulu selesia, mana wolu iminiba selefe. </char></note> <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7">Ais 53.7</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:19">1Fid 1.19</ref></char></note>Obegeba Duluba Hiliseyone Sigilo Hilia adesimo, Yuda ilihe yisi sunia aiyasia saidafalisia, <char style="w" lemma="Boledi Yisida Ofale Subulumo Naiyone Sigilo Hilia">boledi yisida ufuluale</char> subulu nolo. Amogubasu, gilida, yisi amakelelu sunia aiyamale. Ausimo, gili boledi hiligulu miliyobafe. Seale, gili yisida ufuluale boledi labe. Mau enebamo, Yesu <char style="w">Keliso</char> dufa dasigalu labe. Obegeba Duluba Hiliseyone, nine dofene sibi edomo, E labe. <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 16:3">Lo 16.3</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, ninihe sigilo amone naiyo naasu. Sigilo amone naiyo nabiamo, wolu mololo manane yisi amakelelumo afelesia, boledi yisidale subulumo namenale. Boledi yisidale subulu amo, isolu galagololu manada, seale sulu sodo manada amone iminife.<verse eid="1CO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />Sowi no na gilifea seleba mebailumo, nahe gilifea eweguba solu. Idele inolo susugu manada moloba labe ili amodai, ua gegoaba melabiyoba seleba mebailu. <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />Na sulu solu amomo, helefealu idele inolo egesia ligia, susugu manada molosia waalefe ili amodai melabiyoba soluale. Aufia, egesia ligia, asigume inoloda, noolone kegele fa disia waalefe amoda, masega godefea gulugulusia waalefe amoda, ili amodai melabiyoba selesuale. Aubale. Auba ilidai melabiyoba selesiabiaga, gili helefealu ewe afa dedalemaba sabaiyo. <verse eid="1CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 3:6">2Des 3.6</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 3:10">Dai 3.10</ref></char></note>Auluso, uleno abehe, “Na Kelisone damene loluba” selaba ligiaso, ehe susugu mana molosia, asigume ligia, masega godefea gulugulusia, gaidaboba selesia, kagoalo hano nafasia kagoasia, aufia none kegele fa disenaga, amo gilimo, e galiba melabiyo. Aufia, gili idele inolo amogulu galiba naiyoda ua namenabiyo.<verse eid="1CO 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12" />Asigi ule ufuluale idele inolo ili egesia alebaibu amone osolaeyomo, ne dabalula? Aubale koleba. Auluso, idele inolo sese usu alebaibu amone osolaeyomo, gine dabalu koleba. <verse eid="1CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 13:5">Lo 13.5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 17:7">17.7</ref></char></note>Egesia idele inolo ine manamo, Godehe osolaeyobafe. Auluso, Godene bugohe eweguba solu dobu. <char style="qt">“Gilihe inolo wolu gili aleba labe ogomo, baea gadefamale.”</char><verse eid="1CO 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="s">Keliso idele inolo nohe sesene idele inolo nofea fadaamabiyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />Gili <char style="w">keliso idele inolo</char>, gine geleba higinilu dobi isoyo ligiamo, Godene mosomu inolo suniafia, yau inolo labea isoyone lubia aafe amomo, isoluale. Auba molosiale, gilihe sese usu waagi isosenaga, amo isolu koleba. <verse eid="1CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 20:4">MUU 20.4</ref></char></note>Godene <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">muuba kalilu idele inolo</char> ilihe, helefealu kegele sunia osolaeyobafemo, gili asigibualela? Seale, dufiamo, Godene mosomu gilihe, helefealu osolaeyobafe. Aulugulu, sulu higinilu wedideno gili aleba dobumo, gili gine isoyodoluale adefe ogomo, mau enesi ause? Gili gine auba isoyodoluale adefe ogone, gine meleba yuaba mela! <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />Dufiamo, ninihe <char style="w">Godene sulu dia ano</char> ine mana amoda osolaba saeyobafemo, gili asigibualela? Seale, nini auba moloyodolu miliyobafe. Aulugulu, gine miliyolu helefealu iwi adomone sulu wedino kegele holobagafe amoda, gilihe auba isoba osolaba saeyodolu koleba melale.<verse eid="1CO 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />Aulugulu, gili aleba ugi, helefealune miliyo iwi adomone sulu hegesia isoyo dobimo, yau inolo <char style="w">sese</char> usu wida male amofea isomesi gadefafe ogomo, mau enesi ause? <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />Nahe sulu ewemo, gili yuaba ofelesia selesu. Asigi ule ufulu idele inolo gili aleba ugi, sulu hegesia isoyo adesimo, dawalolo dulu inolo sulu amoda isoyonemo, gili aleba ugi ulenoda male labela? <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />Auluso, aga gili gine geleba isosiale, elewo nohe elewo nomo yau idele inolone si saabia, gamane ine fadaalo dobia ami fadaamesi uluba dibia ano. Auba mololo amomo, isoluale koleba. Gili yuamale!<verse eid="1CO 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />Seale koleba, gilihe sese idele inolo noolo fadaamesi uluba dibia ano. Mana amohe walesiamo, gili Kelisone mana mololofealomo hodobailu dobu. Noolohe gilifea woba molosia, gine kegele ogo fa disi, gili waagimasiabiaga, amo nafulubaiyo. <verse eid="1CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />Auluso, gili mana nafulu moloyomo kuliba abiale, gine gili koleba, none kegele fa disia sigiba molafe. Aufia, gine gili koleba, gine gelewodali, ganodalifea, woba moloba labe. <verse eid="1CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:19-21">Gal 5.19-21</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:5">Efe 5.5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:15">MUU 22.15</ref></char></note>Idele inolo woluda moloba labe ili amomo, Godehe Luba Ligia Saminilo ada amone daalomo, ili amo diyobafale. Gili amo asigibualela? Gilihe gine libo ogo gine meleba gegemabiyo. Susugu moloba labemoda, masega godefea guluguluba labemoda, none ido dulu fa diaba labemoda, inolo ine geleba ibolo meba labemoda. <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" />Aufia, none kegele fa difemoda, asigume adoda, hano kagoalo naafeda, nofea gaidaboba selefeda, none kegele dobu sigiba molafeda, idele inolo amogulu ili amo, Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo ada amone daalomo, diyobafale.<verse eid="1CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="TIT 3:3-7">Dai 3.3-7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Saminimo, gili aleba ugi, nooloda mana amo mololabia milibaiba alolu. Auluso, Godehe gili nuguma heefasia, Edai <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu melesi moloba ofolo">muuba kalilu idele inolo koleba melesi gadefalu</char>. <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisone</char> wifea alefasiada, nine <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Godene Asubanene</char> kiwigagalufea alefasiada, Godehe gilifea selesia, “Gili <char style="w" lemma="Godedai isoba melesi moloba ofolo">Ne si saabiamo isolu idele inolo</char> alebaibuba” solu.<verse eid="1CO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nine domalamo Asubane Noekene Ene molo labe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 10:23">1Kld 10.23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Idele inolo noolo selesiamo, “Nahe kegele sunia isoba waagi moloyo dobuba” sodo. Aa, amo seale selefeso, kegele noolo ga molofe amomo, ga nafulu melesi sagoba ufiyobafale. “Nahe kegele sunia isoba waagi moloyo.” Noolo auba sodo. Auluso, na selesia, na kegele ulenohe na uluba ligia, yasifia melesi waagi gadefaeyale.<verse eid="1CO 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TH 4:3-5">1Des 4.3-5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, inolo noolohe besi sulu selesia, “Naiyomo galisalone, aufia galisalomo naiyone dobu. Dufia, Godehe aida amo aalifaba afiyobafe.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">“Naiyomo galisalone, aufia galisalomo naiyone dobu. Dufia, Godehe aida amo aalifaba afiyobafe.” </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Besi sulu ewe selesia, “Ge domalahe amene moloyo hamesenagada, ga waagi moloma. Amo eleda male. Nini olasimo, domala asigileyobafe. Aulugulu, kegele sunia nine domala molofemo, amo woluale.” Idele inolo besi sulu eweda selefemo, ili ine hame waagi kuliba abia, susugu moloyone beega loluba selefe. Auluso, Folo selesia, “Auba hilisemabiyo. Gine domala ogo, eleda male-ale. Aubale. Eleda labe.”</char></note> Auluso, doma. Na eweguba selesu. Nine domala ewemo, susugu moloyone labale. Aubale. Nine domalamo, Saminilone labe. Saminilo E-mo, nine domala ewene yasilo labe. <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:11">Lom 8.11</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 15:20">1Kld 15.20</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 4:14">2Kld 4.14</ref></char></note>Godene kiwigagalu alefasia, Saminilo olalumo <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeba ifolugulu</char>, Ehe nine domalada haiba degeba ifoba yaeyobafe. <verse eid="1CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:30">Efe 5.30</ref></char></note>Gine domala ogo, Yesu Kelisone domala haisi no amone labebamo, gili hilisebualela? Aulugulu, nahe Keliso Ene domala amone haisi noolo difasia, susugu idodai ule adesia, kuliba ofelesenaga, amo nafulula? Amo nafuluale koleba! <verse eid="1CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Stt 2.24</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:5">Mad 19.5</ref></char></note>Inolo abehe, e susugu mololo idodai adesenaga, e ido amodai domala ule adefebamo gili amo asigifalela? Godene bugohe eweguba selelu dobu. <char style="qt">“Aalumo domala ule adefe.”</char> <verse eid="1CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:21-23">Yon 17.21-23</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 8:9-11">Lom 8.9-11</ref></char></note>Auluso, abehe Saminilodai adefe amomo, Edai asubane ule adefe.<verse eid="1CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />Mana wolu sunia, idele inolo mololomo, amo bado saabia egeisialo mololo. Auluso, idele inolohe susugu molofemo, ine domalafea wolu molofe. Aulune, hilia sunia, gili koleba, susugu mana amofea faiso mefia, hago fisaba malale. <verse eid="1CO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" />Gili ewe asigimale. Gine domala ogomo, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenene</char> <char style="w">sebele molo</char> labe. Godehe Asubane Noekenemo gilifea melugulu, E-mo gine domala usu labe. Aulune, gine domalamo, gineale labe. <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 7:23">1Kld 7.23</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:18-19">1Fid 1.18-19</ref></char></note>Aubale. Kelisohe su sulufasia, gili elegeba disi, gili Ene labe. Aulugulu, kegele sunia gine domala ogo molosiamo, Godene wi digiyonesu molomale.<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="s">Folohe ido dilo mana amone solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />Gili sowi nafea seleba mebailu amone sulu kiwi noolomo, aga na gilifea obegeba saeyobasu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 7:1">“Inolohe idodai adesalenaga, amo nafulula?” Gili auba doba abulu amone aga na eweguba obegeba selesu.<verse eid="1CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />Susugu mololo mana amo holobagalosine, inolohe ido difasia, ene eamonodaisu adesenaga, amo nafulu. Aufia, idohe inolo daafia, ene ainodaisu adesenaga, amo nafulu. <verse eid="1CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />Inolo, ido dulu ga-mo, ge geamono heneba ofelesia, edai ule miliyomo kaamabiyo. Aufia ido, inolofea daalu ga-mo, ge gaino heneba ofelesia, edai ule miliyomo kaamabiyo. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />Maumo, ido gahe, ge domala ogomo, gene yasibuale. Ge gaino yasibu. Aubasu, inolo gada, ge domala ogomo, gene yasibuale. Ge geamono yasibu. <verse eid="1CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />Aulugulu, dulu idele inolo gilimo, aine geleba aine domala fogo meyone kaalumabiyo. Aali hilise ule adesia, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu saeyone</char>, hilia fogo abobo eloba ofelesenaga, amo nafulu. Auluso, dufia, aalimo, aine adogubamo melale. Gili auba molosalenaga, ge domalane hame ogo uluba miliyodoluale adesimo, <char style="w" lemma="Sedene">Sedenemo</char> fogo usu amo sugafia, ga dedeba babiyobafe. <verse eid="1CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />Fogo abobo ua hanelo mana afiyoba solu amo, na gilifea auba molomaleba elo ofelesia soluale. Aubale. Na gilifea auba afiyone fogo mesia, waagi auba molomesi gadefasuba solu.<verse eid="1CO 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" />Ne asigimo ewe. Na ido disiale dalali lolu amogubamo, idele inolo sunia auba alebaiyeba asigife. Auluso, Godehe ulu kegele sunia elebi elebibafea melugulu, noolomo ulu kegele dawalolo amo disia, noolomo ulu kegele no dulu alebaibu.<verse eid="1CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />Aufia, agamo, inolo idoda duluale gilifeada, ido inoloda daaluale gilifeada, ido ilisulu gilifeada, na eweguba selesu. Gili na loluguba, dalali adabia daaba elenaga, amo nafulu. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 5:14">1Dim 5.14</ref></char></note>Auluso, gine domalane hamemo, nafuluba uluba miliyodoluale adesenaga, inolo ido disia, ido inolo maiyomo, amo nafulu koleba. Susugu moloyone libo gogalosine selesu.<verse eid="1CO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10-11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.10-11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mad 5.32</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Inolo idoda dulu gilifeada, ido inoloda daalu gilifeada, molomesi sulu saeyobasu. Molomesi sulu selefe ewemo, ne-ale. <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilohe</char> molomaleba elo ufulu sulu amone selesu. Sulu amo ewe. Ido gahe, ge gainomo gadefia afa malabiyo. Aufia, inolo gada, ge geamonomo gadefia afa malabiyo. Auluso, ido gahe, ge gainomo afasia daalunaga, ga-mo inolo nofea abiale, dalali aseloguba mesale. Ga inolo maiyo hilisesenaga, inolo gada dulu amofea haiba obegeba daafia, hilise ule adefia, gaino amodai melale.<verse eid="1CO 7:10-11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />Aufia, na sulu no selesu. Sulu ewe Saminilo solualeso, na asigifeguba selesu. Nelewodali, gili doma. Ge geamonomo asigi ule ufuluale ido ligia, e gadai aso waagi misiyo asigisenaga, amo nelewo, ga ge geamono amo afa malabiyo. <verse eid="1CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />Aufia, ne sigidubulu nanodali, gili doma. Ge gainomo, asigi ule ufuluale inolo ligia, e gadai aso waagi misiyo asigisenaga, amo ne nano, ga ge gaino amo afa malabiyo. <verse eid="1CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />Na auba solumo, mau ewe. Asigi uleda ufulu ido amofea alefasia, ene aino asigi uleda ufulualemo, e Godedai <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu melesi moloba ofolo">muuba kalilu melesi gadefaeyobafe</char>. Aufia, asigi uleda ufulu inolo amofea alefasia, asigi uleda ufuluale eamonomo, eda Godedai muuba kalilu melesi gadefaeyobafe. Auba ausialebiaga, aine faibe amoda Godene si saabia nugumada alebaiyo. Auluso, Godehe ewe seale auba moloba ofologulu, aine faibe ili amoda, Godene si saabiamo nugumada male, <char style="w">muuba kalilu</char> labe.<verse eid="1CO 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 14:19">Lom 14.19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auluso, asigi ule ufuluale inolohe, ene eamono asigi ule ufulu amo, afa maiyo asigisenaga, amo nano, gahe e waagi malesi gadefamale. Aufia, asigi ule ufuluale idohe, ene aino asigi ule ufulumo gadefia maiyo asigisenaga, amo nelewo, gahe e waagi malesi gadefamale. Ausenaga, sigidubulu elewodai, enanodai amo sububa dafelesia, beega miliyobafe. Maumo, Godehe nini noolodalimo gadaeaba mesesi iminiba ufulu. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:1">1Fid 3.1</ref></char></note>Nanodali, ga mana molofe ogo alefasia, ge gaino <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba diyobafebile</char>. Nelewodali, ga mana molofe ogo alefasia, ge geamono gasiba dafelagoba diyobafebile.<verse eid="1CO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Godehe ga-mo halagulu labi welu, hamagi adabia malale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />Nini ule ulebafea Saminilohe ge-ba iminiba ufulu dobia ami, adabia malale. Godehe ga ami melesiba welu. Na siba ligiamo, <char style="w">sese</char> suniafea ili auba melaleba waleba ado. <verse eid="1CO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />Godehe ga bado amaleba gelelu labi welunaga, amo ga bado amaleba gelelualegulu alebaiyeba asigimabiyo. Aufia, Godehe ga bado amaleba geleluale labi welunaga, amo ga bado amaleba gelemabiyo. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:25">Lom 2.25</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 5:6">Gal 5.6</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 6:15">6.15</ref></char></note>Enebamo, <char style="w" lemma="Bado amaleba gelelo mana">bado amaleba gelelune</char> manamo, eleda male. Aufia, bado amaleba geleluale mana amoda, eleda male kegele. Godene molomalelu sulu kuliba maiyo mana amosumo, ele bule koleba dobu. <verse eid="1CO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />Godehe ga halagulu labi welu amo, ga hamagi adabia malale.<verse eid="1CO 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />Godehe ga <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">balu dabalu mololo</char> labi welunaga, ga amone keleba hilisemabiyo. Auluso, ga beega miliyone fogo besenaga, amo ga fogo hamagi melale. <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:16">Flm 1.16</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:16">1Fid 2.16</ref></char></note>Maumo, eweguba asigima. Balu dabalu mololo faibe Gode alefasia welu labemo, e Godene si saabiamo, sububa dafogolu beega labe. Aufia, nolobalo amoda. Beega ado inolo Gode alefasia welu labemo, e <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisone</char> dabalu moloyone, seale Ene balu dabalu mololo faibe labe. <verse eid="1CO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />Ehe su sulufasia, gili elegeba dulu. Aulugulu, aga E ge biso labi, ga koleba helefealu inolo ge biso melesi waagi gadefamabiyo. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />Aulugulu, ne damenedali, Godehe ga halaguiya labi welubi, gili koleba gili aloiya hamagisu Godedai melale.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Idele inolo dalali alebaibu amone solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />Nahe idele inolo dalali alebaibu amone saeyobasu. Saminilohe nafea ili auba molomaleba soluale. Auluso, Godehe na <char style="w" lemma="Kanululo">kanulusia</char>, na-mo sulu seale sodo inolo melesi moloba ufulune, nene asigifeguba saeyobasu. <verse eid="1CO 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />Fogo aga ewemo, higinilu bule holobagafe ewene na hilisesia, gili aga labe hamagulu adabia daaba melale. <verse eid="1CO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />Ga ido dulunaga, ido ogo afiyo hilisemabiyo. Ga ido dulualenaga, ido diyo isamabiyo. <verse eid="1CO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" />Auluso, ga ido disenaga, amo ga wolu molofale. Ausi, ido buda ga, inolo aafe amoda, amo ga wolu molofale. Auluso, eweguba hilisema. Idoda dulu idele inolo, ilifea higinilu holobagaeyobafe. Gili higinilu amo elaba daafia malesisia, na gilifea aga sulu ewe selesu.<verse eid="1CO 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" />Ne damenedali, sulu na solu amone fadaba selesu. Helefealu iwi fogo abobofegulu, fogo nini aso dobia amimo, inolo ido dulu ga-mo, ge geamono amosu hilisebasu melabiyo. <verse eid="1CO 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />Aufia, idele inolo yagunagasia, kuanoba yegiliba labe gilimo, kuanosia yegilibasu melabiyo. Idele inolo heneba labe gilimo, henebasu melabiyo. Idele inolo kegeleda elegeba labe gilimo, kegele amosu hilisebasu melabiyo. <verse eid="1CO 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:17">1Yon 2.17</ref></char></note>Idele inolo helefealu kegele ewene dabaluda molofe gilimo, dabalu amomo olaibo kegeleba hilisefia mololabiasu malabiyo. Maumo, helefealu iwi aga mana mololo kegele amo sunia asigileyobafe.<verse eid="1CO 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />Na hamefemo, gili helefealu iwi keleba hilisesia, gine asigi ogo sigiba yaamesiale hamefe. Inolo ido duluale amohe, Saminilo henemesine hilisesia, ene asigi Saminilone kegelefea asigi gagabasu ado. <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33" />Auluso, ido dulu inolo ehe, ene eamono henemesine uluba labi, helefealune kegele amohe, ene asigi sigibasu ado. E auba sigiba ligia, asigi aida labe. <verse eid="1CO 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34" />Aufia, ido dalali labe e-mo, Saminilone kegelefea asigi gagabasu ado. Auba ligia, e ene asubanefealomoda, ene domalafealomoda, Godedai <char style="w">muuba kalilu</char> miliyo hamelo. Idele budasile ilida auba aulo. Auluso, ido inolofea daalu e-mo, ene aino henemesi uluba ligiamo, helefealune kegele amohe ene asigi sigibasu ado. <verse eid="1CO 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />Sulu na selesu ewemo, gili nafulu mesesi sagoba ofelesia selesu. Aubasu molomaleba elo ofelesia selesuale. Gili mana isolusu amone kuliba malesi selesu. Gili asigi aida melesiale, Saminilofea asigi gagabasu daaba melesi selesu.<verse eid="1CO 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />Aufia, inolo idoda saaba melu labe amo ga, doma. Ga gene domalane hameda uluba miliyodoluale ligia, ge saamelu idofea mana isoluale mololosiba hilisesenaga, amo eno no male, ga asigifeguba moloyone, ido amo ifosi dimale. Amo isolugulu, ga wolu molofale. <verse eid="1CO 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />Auluso, ga koleba gene domalane hameda uluba miliyodolu ligia, ga asigifeguba, ga ido diyaleba asigisia, kiwigaafia esenaga, amo ido dimabiyo. Aali auba dalali adesenaga, amo nafulu. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />Aulugulu, inolohe ido efea saaba melu amo ifosi disenaga, amo nafulu. Aufia, inolohe ido efea saaba melu amo disalenaga, amo nafulu molofe koleba.<verse eid="1CO 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.39 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 7:2-3">Lom 7.2-3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Idohe aino aso bebea saabimo, e ainodai godaiba ufia labe. Auluso ene aino olasenaga, ido amo e sububa dafogolu dobugulu, inolo nofeamo maiyone e waagi beega labe. Auluso, e inolo aasenaga, sigidubulu inolo amofeasu malale. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />Auluso, na eweguba hilisesu. Ido ilisulu amo e labe hamagulu, dalali asefalu adesenaga, e henelo bule miliyobafe. Auba selesumo, na asigifeguba gilifea selesu. Auba asigisiamo, nada <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Godene Asubane</char> nafea labeba asigisu.<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Folohe kelebulu huu ili masega godefea ulu soba melu amone selefe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 15:29">HD 15.29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aga na sulu kiwi no saeyobasu. Amo ewe. Kelebulu huu masega godefea soba melu amone na saeyobasu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 8:1">Inolo noolo selesia, “Nini sunia asigida dulu loluba” sodo. Auluso, na selesia, “Asigilo dilo mana amohe idele inolo boleba ofelesi, ili ine meleba bamabamasia selefebu. Auluso, hameselo mana amohe idele inolo kiwigaaba ofolo. <verse eid="1CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 6:3">Gal 6.3</ref></char></note>Idele inolo abehe, e asigilo bule dulu loluba hilisesenaga, e asigilo sealemo aso duluale labe. <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />Auluso, idele inolo abehe, Gode bule hamesesenaga, Godehe ili amo nafuluba fadaba asigibu.”<verse eid="1CO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 4:8">Gal 4.8</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:39">Lo 4.39</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 6:4">6.4</ref></char>
    </note>Aulune, idele inolo kelebulu huu <char style="w" lemma="Masega gode">masega godefea</char> soba melu amo naasenaga, amo nafulula, me nafulualela?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 8:4">Amone na aga gilifea saeyobasu. Gili asigibu, helefealu iwi masega gode labe ilimo, mimisililu balu labe. Ule E-su, Gode seale labe. <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />Inolo noolo selesia, “Helefealu iwida, anakiwi lagida, gode alebaibuba” sodo. Seale, anakiwida, helefealuda, yasibu amo godegulu wedinale labe. <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:5">Efe 4.5</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 4:6">6</ref></char></note>Auluso, asigi ule ufulu idele inolo ninihe ewe asigibu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1CO 8:6" />
  <para style="qc" vid="1CO 8:6">Gode E-su, ule labe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="1CO 8:6">Nine Nao, amo E.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="1CO 8:6">Kegele sunia mololu ewene maumo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="1CO 8:6">E labe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="1CO 8:6">Nine miliyolune maumo, E labe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="1CO 8:6">
    <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilomo</char> ule E-su labe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="1CO 8:6">Yesu <char style="w">Keliso</char>, amo E.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="1CO 8:6">Godehe kegele sunia</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="1CO 8:6">Yesufea alefasia</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="1CO 8:6">moloba samodolu dobu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="1CO 8:6">Ninimo Efeasu alefasia</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="1CO 8:6">miliyolu disu.<verse eid="1CO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />Auluso, keliso idele inolo noolohe auba fadaba asigibale alebaibu. Samini, ili hilia sunia masega gode amofea gulugululugulu, ilihe aga kelebulu huu masega godefea soba melu amo difasia, nabiamo, ili aso eweguba hilisefe. “Nini huu ewe naasumo alefasia, nini masega gode amofea gulugulusububa” hilisefe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fogo ami, Giligi helea ami, dauno kakainalu ilihe kelebulu huu naiyo hilisesiamo, masega godene sebele moloa ami daafia, elegebasu ado. Sebele moloa ami, kelebulu huu masega godefea soba mefasia, amone haisi haisiba, idele inolofea elegeyone ofolo. Masega godefea soba meluale huu amo, sidi me dauno ami elegelale. </char></note> Ili amo auba asigi aida adesia, ilimo, “Na heleba mololuba” hilisefe. Auba hilisesiamo, ine <char style="w">asigi nafulune si</char> sawaba babale ligia, yuaba labe.<verse eid="1CO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" />Auluso, eweguba asigima. Naiyo nolo mana amohe, nini uluba dibia abia, Gode aniba melesi gadefalale. Aulugulu, nini naiyo naafe amohe, nini woba dafiyobafale. Aufia, nolobaloda, nini naiyo aiyasia naafale amohe, nini Godedai nafuluba melesi moloba ufiyobafale. Amo seale.<verse eid="1CO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 14:13-15">Lom 14.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 5:13">Gal 5.13</ref></char>
    </note>Gili auba asigisiamo, eweguba hilisefe. “Ninimo, nini hamefeguba, huu sunia naiyone beega loluba” hiliseba labe. Amo seale, gili auba moloyone beega labe. Auluso, auba hiliseba labe gili, nafuluba! Sigidubulu damene kiwidale alebaibu ilihe, gili huu auba beega naafe amofea ifili sauwasia gelebailosi, sigidubulu kiwida alebaibu gili, mana gili molofe amo nafuluba uluba melale. <verse eid="1CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />Enebamo, ge damene kiwidale labe amohe bisigia, ga masega godene sebele moloa sugafia, ami yoba sigia, huu naba labi besenaga, amo ga naafe amohe, e sigiba dibia aasi, eda masega godefea soba melu huu naiyobafe. Ausi, naafe amohe, e haiba masega godefea guluguluyone seseayobafe. <verse eid="1CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:15">Lom 14.15</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 14:20">20</ref></char></note>Ausimo, gili huu amo naiyone beega lolusia molofe amohe, inolo kiwidale labe amo woba ofelefe. Asigima. Inolo amo, ge damene labe. Yesu Keliso Ehe e gasiba dafelagoba diyofia olalu. <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />Aulune, gili auba gine damene ene <char style="w">asigi nafulune si</char> haloaba ofelesia, ilifea wolu molofe amo alefasia, gili Yesu Kelisofea wolu molofe. <verse eid="1CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:21">Lom 14.21</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, naiyo na naafe amohe, nelewodaline, nanodaline asigi ule ufulu woyodolu besenaga, kelebulu huu sunia amo, hilia sunia na nabale afiyoba. Ne damenedali asigi ule ufulufealomo hodobailosi.<verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="s">Hilibaisi daalu inolo ine elebe dilo amone solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 22:17-18">HD 22.17-18</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:16">26.16</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 15:8-9">1Kld 15.8-9</ref></char>
    </note>Inolo none dabalu mololale, beega alolu inolo ulenomo, na-basi. <char style="w">Hilibaisi daalu inolo</char> ulenomo, na lolubasi. Nine <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Yesuda abulu inolo ulenomo, na lolubasi. Nahe Saminilone dabalu molosi, sebe helelu amo, gili koleba labe. <verse eid="1CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 3:2-3">2Kld 3.2-3</ref></char></note>Inolo noolohe hilisesiamo, na-mo hilibaisi daalu inolo labaleba hilisefe. Waagima. Gilihe na hilibaisi daalu inolo labeba asigibu. Enebamo, gili koleba, na dabalu molosi, keliso idele inolo holobagalu. Aulugulu, gili auba keliso idele inolo labe amohe, na-mo hilibaisi daalu inolo seale labebamo iminiba ofelesia, gaduba walefe.<verse eid="1CO 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />Inolohe na dufa dafogoba selesimo, nahe ilifea nene meleba subuyo sulu eweguba obegeba selesu. <verse eid="1CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />Dabalu Banabasada, ani molofe amo alefasia, elebe diloguba, naiyodai, hanodai, isoba diyonemo, ani wida soluale lolubile? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />Hilibaisi daalu inolo nooloda, Yesu Ene elewodali nooloda, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Sifaseda</char>, ilihe ine eamonodalimo uluba dibia siba alolu amoguba, anida auba moloyonemo, wida soluale lolubile? <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />Hilibaisi daalu inolo noolomo, Godene dabalu molomesine, mole dabalu molosiale, beega gadefafia labe. Amogubasu beega miliyonemo, <char style="w" lemma="Banabasa">Banabasada</char> anibisu, wida soluale lolubile?<verse eid="1CO 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />Doma. Yobolo inolo ilihe ine mole koleba difasia, dabalu ili mololumone elebemo, elegelale koleba. Aufia, inolo edoda gelumo, gelu amone sebe sufasia, ene nolo. Aufia, inolo dofene sibida uluba adomo, ine bu hano wasifasia, haisimo ene nolo. <verse eid="1CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />Nahe helefealu inolone mololo mana amonesu difasia selesuale. Aubale. Godene sulu <char style="w">muguli</char> amoda hamagane selefe.<verse eid="1CO 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 25:4">Lo 25.4</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1Dim 5.18</ref></char>
    </note>Doma. <char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Mosesene</char> sulu mugulihe eweguba selelu dobu. “<char style="qt"><char style="w" lemma="Dofene keao">Dofene keaone</char> gibohe, widi sebe amone sao fifimesi saabia emelalabia daaba labimo, e namenesi fogo mesia, ene mofe dofamabiyo.</char>” Sulu auba solumo, Godehe dofene keao amone keleba asigisia selesia, aufale. <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 2:6">2Dim 2.6</ref></char></note>Aubale. Godehe nini hilisesia solu. Seale, sulu ewe selesiamo, nini sagoba ufiyone solu. Enebamo, inolohe edo geyone hele olabofe amoda, aufia inolohe sebe sufe amoda, aaluhe dabalu molosiamo, aine dabalu molofe amofeafia dufia naiyo naiyoba hilisesia, auba mololo.<verse eid="1CO 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 15:27">Lom 15.27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gine asubanefealomo, ani edo nafulu gili aleba ugi geba ufulugulu, aga anine domalafealomo, anihe gilifeafia sebe suiyo hamesenaga, amo lilibualebile? <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:34">HD 20.34</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 11:9">2Kld 11.9</ref></char></note>Walelo noolohe ine domalafealomo gilifeafia sebe sumesine, gili eelu. Amo ililibu. Enebamo, ili dabalu molofasia, sebe suiyone wida alebaibu. Aulugulu, eweguba asigima. Anine sonehe, gili aleba edo gelu amo alefasia, anida sebe suiyonemo, wida bule koleba lolu. Aulune, anida gilifeafia sebe sumesine, gili eesiabiaga, amo ililibaiye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 9:12">Auluso, hilibaisi daalu dabalu mololo amone wifea alefasia, ani sagoba homesi, anihe gilifea boboleba selesuale. Aubale. Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisone</char> sulu nafulu kaalosine, ani waagisia, hamalu.<verse eid="1CO 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 18:1-3">Lo 18.1-3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gilihe sulu ewe asigima. Godene <char style="w" lemma="Sebele Molo">sebele moloa</char> dabaluda molofe inolo ilimo, naiyo sebele moloa ami dobu amone difasia, nolo. Aufia, ulu <char style="w">soba melo inolo</char> ilimo, defene olaboiya soba mesia, kelebulu huu haisi afelefemone, ili nolo. <verse eid="1CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:10">Mad 10.10</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 6:6">Gal 6.6</ref></char></note>Auba moloba ado amogubamo, Saminilo Ehe, nini walelo inolofea naiyo auba memaleba solu. Inolo Yesune awalu sulu nafuluda walefe ilimo, kegele ine domala sagoba ufiyone diyobafemo, idele inolo awalu sulu nafuluda dobelefe ilihe mefe amone, ili diyobafe.<verse eid="1CO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />Auluso, sulu selesu ewene kuliba abia, nene na molosuale. Aufia, aga gilihe na sagoba homesi selesuale. Seale, na gilifeafia sagoba ofolo disiabiaga, na nene meleba kaiiba saeyodoluale alebaiyo. Na nene meleba kaiiba selesiale, na mamiaba olasiabiaga, amo nafulubaiyo. <verse eid="1CO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 20:9">Jer 20.9</ref></char></note>Godehe nafea awalu sulu nafulu waleba melalelu. Aulune, na awalu sulu walesiamo, na nene meleba kaiiba ligia, wi digiyodoluale. Enebamo, na no moloyone eno male koleba. Na awalu sulu nafulu walesialebiaga, yeele, na nafulu asebaiyale. <verse eid="1CO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />Aulune, dabalu na molosu ewemo nene asigihe mololubiaga, amo na elebe isoba dibaiyo. Auluso, aga nene asigihe sulu waleba loluale. Aubale. Godehe nafea molomalesi, na molosu. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />Aulugulu, dabalu na molosu amo, elebe amene diyobafe? Elebe amo ewe. Na awalu sulu nafulu walesiamo, na dabalu mololu amone sebe suiyone wimo afelesia, sabe diyo hamebale lolu amo alefasia, na nene meleba kaiisu. Kaiiba ado amo, na elebe diloguba disu.<verse eid="1CO 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />Na inolo ulenofeafia elebe dilale labimo, inolo ulenohe na yasilale. Aulugulu, na beega lolu. Auluso, na auba beega ligia, na nene asigifeguba mololale. Aubale. Nene na-mo, idele inolo sunia sisa ufulu. Ili Godefea asigi ule homesine, na ine dabalu balu moloba lolu.<verse eid="1CO 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 21:20-26">HD 21.20-26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulugulu, <char style="w">Yuda</char> idele inolo Yesu labea ulubia miyo ligiamo, na Yuda ilidai sigiamo, nada iligulu adesia, ine mana amoda kuliba daaba ado.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="1CO 9:20">Aufia, nene na Mosesene sulu muguli saaba ufulu amone sisa loluale. Auluso, sulu mugulida kuliba ano idele inolo ili Yesu labea uluba dia miyo ligiamo, iligulu adesia, nada muguli amo kuliba daaba ado.<verse eid="1CO 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />Aufia, mugulida male idele inolo ili amone obegeba diyofia, na ilidai sigiamo, iligulu adesia, nada mugulida male inologulu ado. Na auba ligiaso, na Godene sulu muguli afelesia auluale. Aubale. Na Kelisone sulu muguli sisasu ado.<verse eid="1CO 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 11:29">2Kld 11.29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, kiwida sanelu idele inolo ili amone obegeba diyofia, na ilidai sigiamo, iligulu adesia, nada kiwida sanelu inolo ado.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="1CO 9:22">Aubamo, idele inolo noolo <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba diyone</char>, na eno sunia dedeba isasia, idele inolo suniagulu ado.<verse eid="1CO 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />Nahe auba mololomo, Yesune awalu sulu nafulu amo kiwigaaba homesifia mololo. Auba moloba ligiamo, edililo kegele awalu sulu nafulu amofeafia holobagaba labemo, nada ili suniada ua heneba diyone mololo.<verse eid="1CO 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ninihe elebe diyone kiwigaaba waseba wasebaba naguba maiyoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />Inolo daisia naguba anomo, gili asigima. Inolo wedinalehe waseba wasebaba naguba maiyobafeso, inolo suniafe amo e-su, elebe diyobafe. Ga auba naguba abiamo, suniaeyosia, ga koleba, kiwigaafia ligia, elebe diyonesu naguba mala. <verse eid="1CO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 3:14">Fil 3.14</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:7-8">2Dim 4.7-8</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 2:4-5">2.4-5</ref></char></note>Inolo elebe diyo hilisesia, daiyo ligiamo, ine domala uluba ligia, elebe diyo amone kiwigagaba dailo. Helefealu iwi dailo amone elebe dife amo, dufia asigileyobafe. Auluso, ninimo asigilelale elebe diyone, nine meleba uluba ligia, suniaeyonesia naguba maiyoba.<verse eid="1CO 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />Aulugulu, nahe Godene dabalu moloba ligiamo, na balu anale. Aubale. Na maiyo asogosu sidafia, migagaba naguba aasu. Inolo ulenohe sone musu belagusia, balu doweba heleloguba, na mololale. <verse eid="1CO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:13">Lom 8.13</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 13:14">13.14</ref></char></note>Aubale. Nahe ne domala ewe uluba ligiamo, doweba yaasia, ne domalamo, ne balu dabalu mololo faibe melesi mololo. Nahe awalu sulu nafulumo idele inolo noolofea walefasia, dufia ne elebe diyo ufulumo, diba dafolosi.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Ninimo Isolaelene enauwadali mololuguba molomabiyoba haguguba solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 13:21-22">Kis 13.21-22</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 14:22-29">14.22-29</ref></char>
    </note>Maumo, ne damenedali, gilihe nine nauwadali mololumo nafuluba asigima. Mosese ehe nine nauwadali uluba dibia inigiamo, ili sunia kene iwa sisa alefasia dedaleba alolu. Aufia, ili sunia Salu Hano Genelu amo segefia milibailu. <figure style="fig" alt="Israelites cross sea" file="02_Ex_14_07_RG_gr.tif" size="col" copy="© Sweet Publishing http://sweetpublishing.com, licensed under a CC: BY-SA 3.0 Unported licence." ref="10.1-4">Isolaele idele inolo ilimo Salu Hano Genelu segesimo, hano kiwi dogolea dedalesi, hano gelelu aidamo hele galegulu gaalu.</figure> <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" />Nini <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano gelu</char> amogubamo, ilida kene iwa usu ami gefia, salu hano amone usu amida gelu. Ili auba hano gelumo, <char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Mosesene</char> damene adefesia, iminisia geba waalelu. <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:35">Kis 16.35</ref></char></note>Ili suniahe, Godene Asubanene naiyo <char style="sls"><char style="w">mena</char></char> melu hamagane naba yaalu. <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 17:6">Kis 17.6</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 20:11">Nam 20.11</ref></char></note>Aufia, Godene Asubanene hano melu hamagane amoda ili ua naba yaalu. Godene Asubanene abane ilidai siba alolu amofeafia, hano holobagalu amone mololu. Abane ili galiba siba alolu amomo, Yesu <char style="w">Keliso</char> Ene E waaga. <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:29-30">Nam 14.29-30</ref></char></note>Ili auba moloba aloluso, Godehe idele inolo ili wedinale amone mana bisigia, henebale alolu. Aulune, ili falalu helea hamagi daneba yaasia, ine domalamo hamagi diba galabia daalu.<verse eid="1CO 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 10:11">1Kld 10.11</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 11:4">Nam 11.4</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 11:34">34</ref></char>
    </note>Kegele sunia ili samini mololu amomo, nini aga eloba bafasia dawalomesine dedeba moloba ufulu. Aufia, ili samini wolu moloyone mesegeluguba, ninida auba moloyone mesegelosine aulu. <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:6">Kis 32.6</ref></char></note>Ili noolo samini mololu amoguba, gili masega godefea gulugulumabiyo. Godene Bugohe eweguba selelu dobu. “<char style="qt">Ili naiyo naba, hano naba kakainafia ligia, ibaba yaasia, asigi degesiamo, idele galiba dedaisia waalelo.</char>” <verse eid="1CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:1-9">Nam 25.1-9</ref></char></note>Aufia, ili noolohe samini susugu mana mololuguba, nini auba molomabiyo. Enebamo, ili amo auba mololumo alefasia, hilia ule hamagisu, 23,000 daneba yaalu. <verse eid="1CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:5-6">Nam 21.5-6</ref></char></note>Ilihe samini mololu amoguba, ninihe Kelisomo dedeba bamabiyo. Enebamo, samini ili aleba noolohe Saminilo dedeba besabi, soiye woluhe ili amo mubagagasi, daneba yaalu. <verse eid="1CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" />Aufia, ili noolohe Godefea gogomoluguba, gilihe auba gogomomabiyo. Enebamo, samini ili aleba noolo gogomosi, sulu dia ano, inoloda woba dafalilo amo, ehe ili dufa danelu.<verse eid="1CO 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />Kegele ilifea mololu amomo, ninihe momoleba bamesine dedeba moloba ufulu. Fogo aga nini lolu ewemo, aleba eloyo fogo adefegulu, ili mololuguba molomabiyosia, hagugulu sulu amo, ninifea seleba dobu. <verse eid="1CO 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />Aulugulu, asigi ule ufulu idele inolo abehe, “Na kiwigaafia kalugaafia loluba” hilisesenaga, amo gili nafuluba melale. Gili gelebailosi. <verse eid="1CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />Dedeba babiyo nokene nokeneba gili labea holobagafemo, nogulu koleba holobagalale. Aubale. Idele inolo sunia labea holobagaloguba, gili labeada imini ule aiba holobagalo. Godehe Ene sulu saaba ufulumo asigifia, fedoba sefia ligia, dedeba babiyo gili labea holobagasi, gili kaamo miliyodoluale amo, gili labea holobagamesi gadefaeyobafale. Aubale. Dedeba babiyo gilifea holobagasimo, Godehe gili higinilu amofea alefasia siba daafia malesine, eno moloyobafe. Ehe gili kiwigaafia kalugaamesi moloba ofelesimo, dedeba besabe amohe gili dufa dafogoyobafale.<verse eid="1CO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ninihe Godefea gulugulusiamo, asubane wolu noolofeada gulugulumabiyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />Aulugulu, ne yagusodali koleba, gili masega gode ili ogofea gulugulumabiyo koleba. Mana amofeamo hago melale. <verse eid="1CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />Gili asigida dulu labegulu, sulu na selesu ewemo, gine nafuluba osolaba asigimale. <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:26-28">Mad 26.26-28</ref></char></note>Ninihe <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo asigisia naiyo nolo">Yesu asigisia naiyo nabiamo</char>, Godefea henelu sulu saafia, hano gaabu wasulu nolo. Naafe amohe, Kelisone ibifea alefasia, ninimo Edai kulimesi gegoaba ofelefe. Aufia, nini <char style="w">boledi</char> gogolefia naafe amoda, Kelisone domalafea alefasia, ninimo Edai kulimesi gegoaba ofelefe. <verse eid="1CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:5">Lom 12.5</ref></char></note>Maumo, nolu filu ule ufulugulu, idele inolo wedinale nini saabe ewehe, nolu filu ule hamagane naba ado amofea alefasia, nini domala ule lolu.<verse eid="1CO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 7:6">Wkp 7.6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mana <char style="w">Isolaele</char> idele inolo ili mololomo, gili asigima. Kelebulu huuda defene olaboiya ami soba melo ilimo, ili huu amone haisi ua nolo. Mana auba molofe amofea alefasia, ili Godedai ua naba ligia, Edai dafifia ado. <verse eid="1CO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 8:4">1Kld 8.4</ref></char></note>Sulu na selesu ewemo, na ene hilisesia selefebi? Kelebulu huu <char style="w" lemma="Masega gode">masega godefea</char> soba melu amomo, bule kegelemo, eweba selesia aufebile? Aubale. Masega gode mimisililu mololu amomo, bule kegelemo, eweba selesia aufebile? <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:17">Lo 32.17</ref>; <ref loc="REV 9:20">MUU 9.20</ref></char></note>Auba koleba selesuale. Auluso, na eweguba selesu. Yau idele inolohe, kelebulu huu soba melu amomo Godefea mesiale, <char style="w" lemma="Gamodo">gamodofea</char> meba ado. Aulugulu, na hilisesiamo, gili gamodo amodai ua dafifia melabiyoba koleba selesu. <verse eid="1CO 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 6:15-16">2Kld 6.15-16</ref></char></note>Gilihe <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilone</char> hano gaabu wasulu amoda naiyo, aufia gamodone hano gaabu wasulu amoda naiyo, gili aidaba auba namenabiyo. Aufia, gilihe Saminilone ailaiya amida, naiyo naiyoba, aufia gamodone ailaiya amida, naiyo naiyoba aidaba melabiyo. <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:21">Lo 32.21</ref></char></note>Ninihe Saminilo Ene libo wosia, habomesi molomabiyo. Nine kiwigagalu ewehe, Ene kiwigagalumo sunialububa asigimabiyo.<verse eid="1CO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Godene wi bule amone digiba ofelesia molomale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 6:12">1Kld 6.12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Noolo eweguba sodo. “Ninihe kegele sunia isoba waagi moloyodolu.” Auluso, na eweguba selesu. “Auba dobuso, kegele noolo nini molofe amohe, nini nafulu mesesi moloba ufiyobafale.” Noolohe selesia, “Ninihe kegele sunia isoba waagi moloyodoluba” sodo. Auluso, na selesia, “Gili auba saeyodolu dobuso, kegele noolo nini molofe amohe, nini kiwigaaba ufiyobafale. <verse eid="1CO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:1-2">Lom 15.1-2</ref></char></note>Ninihe, nine melebasu sagoba ufiyone migagabasu malabiyo. Aubale. Gilihe noolo anogo sagoba ufiyone asigimale.”<verse eid="1CO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />Kelebulu huu sunia magede ami ofelefemo, gili waagi elegefia namenale. Gilihe keleba hilisefia, doba bebeleba yaamabiyo. <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 24:1">Sng 24.1</ref></char></note>Maumo, Godene bugohe eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1CO 10:26" />
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 10:26">
    <char style="qt">“Helefealu eweda,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 10:26">
    <char style="qt">kegele helefealu iwi dobu eweda,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 10:26">
    <char style="qt">amo sunia Saminilo Enesu dobu.”</char><verse eid="1CO 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" />Aulune, asigi ule ufuluale idele inolo noolohe, ga naiyo naiyo milesi wesenaga, ami abiamo, naiyo halagulu gafea mesenagada, ga waagi difasia namenale. Huu amo wagifia duluba doba babale, waagi namenale. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 8:7">1Kld 8.7</ref></char></note>Auluso, inolo nohe gafea selesia, “Kelebulu huu ewe, masega godefea ulu soba meluba” selesenaga, amo koleba, kelebulu huu amo, ga namenabiyo. Gahe inolo auba selefe amo sagoba ofelesiamo, ehe ga heleba molofeba asigisia, ene <char style="w">asigi nafulune si</char> wolosi, huu amo namenabiyo. <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />Gene ga heleba mololu amone, na selesuale. Aubale. Auluso, idele inolo noolohe, ga heleba molofeba hilisesia, ine asigi nafulune sihe auba keleba hiliselosi selesu. Idele inolo noolohe heleba mololuba keleba asigisalenaga, amo kegele sunia waagi namenale. Na beega lolune, isoba moloyodolu lolu. Aulune, inolo noolone asigi nafulune sihe na molomabusia kaafe amo enesi aufebi? <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 4:4">1Dim 4.4</ref></char></note>Nahe naiyo nabiamo, Godefea henelu sulu saafia, naasenaga, idele inolo noolohe na heleba amene molosi, saaba duduba selefebi?<verse eid="1CO 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 3:17">Kol 3.17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulugulu, ga naiyo naafe amoda, me hano naafe amoda, me ga amene kegele sunia molofe amoda, Godene wi bule amone digiba ofelesia, molomale. <verse eid="1CO 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:13">Lom 14.13</ref></char></note>Gili auba moloba ligiamo, <char style="w">Yuda</char> idele inoloda, Giligi idele inoloda, aufia Godefea asigi ule ufulu idele inoloda, ili gelebailosi, mana gili molofe amo nafuluba bamale. <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:20-22">1Kld 9.20-22</ref></char></note>Mana na molosu amomo, idele inolo sunia henemesi mololo. Na nene meleba heneyo amonesu mololale. Godehe idele inolo wedinalemo, <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba obegeba dimesine</char> selesu.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 4:16">1Kld 4.16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisohe</char> mana mololo amoguba, nada E kuliba abiamo, aubasu molosu. Aulugulu, mana na mololabia kuliba aasu eweguba, gilida aubasu kuliba abia, moloba melale.<verse eid="1CO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folohe sese usu ami gunia gasiagufia aselo mana amone solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />Nahe gine wimo digisia, kaiiba selesu. Enebamo, gilihe hilia sunia na hiliselabia dedalesia, sulu mana na gilifea walelu amomo asigifia ligia, sefia labe. <verse eid="1CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:16">Stt 3.16</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:23">Efe 5.23</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, nahe sulu ewe gili nafuluba fadaba asigimesi hamefe. Inolo suniane gunimo, Keliso labe. Aufia, idele suniane gunimo, inolo labe. Aufia, Keliso Ene gunimo, Gode labe. <verse eid="1CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />Inolo sunia abehe, Godedai sulu selesiada, saaba ofa selesiada, ene guni gasiagufia selesenaga, amo ehe ene guni Yesu Kelisomo yuaba ofelefe. <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />Aufia, idele sunia abehe, Godedai sulu selesiada, saaba ofa selesiada, ene guni gasiagubale ligia selesenaga, amo ehe ene guni amone yuaba ofelefe. Ido amo auba molofemo, ene guni alu sunia gaseba dafulu bologuba besabe. <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />Idele gili guni gasiagubale Godedai sulu saeyone yuasalenaga, wae! Gili gine guni alu sunia gelesiabiaga, amo nafulu babaiye. Auluso, gilihe gine guni alu aboboba gelesia, gaseba dafiyomo yuasenaga, amo gilihe gine guni amo gasiaguyo dobu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sesene dawalolu inolo noolohe eweguba hilisefe. Folohe iwi idele ili ine guni gasiagumaleba selesiamo, ine domalane gunifea iminife. Aulugulu, sese amone guni inolo selesia, idele sunia gulugulusiamo, ine domalane guni gasiagumaleba selefe. Auluso, sesene dawalolu inolo noolohe eweguba hilisefe. Folohe sulu ewe selesiamo, Giligi idele inolo ine mana amone kuliba abia, sulu selefe. Ausi, sese amone guni inolo selesia, nini aga iwi ligia, Giligi ine mana kuliba daabale adogulu, nine idele ine guni gasiaguyone dabalu maleba selefe. Gasiagumaba selesenagada, me gasiagumabiyoba selesenagada, hama. Sulu amone kiwimo ewe: idele ine gunimo, ine aino koleba labe. Aulugulu, Folohe idelefea, gili gulugulusia, gine guni yuaba homabiyolumo, ilifea ine aino yuaba homabiyosia iminife.</char></note><verse eid="1CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 1:26-27">Stt 1.26-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Inolohe ene guni gasiagumabiyo. Enebamo, e-mo Godene kiwigagaludai, Ene wi <char style="w" lemma="Elalelu">elalelumodai</char>, mimisililu labeba ulufaba walefe. Auluso, idohe inolone kiwigagalu amodai, ene wi elalelu amodai, walefe. <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:18-23">Stt 2.18-23</ref></char></note>Maumo, Godehe inolomo idone domalafeafia mololuale. Aubale. Ehe idomo inolone domalafeafia mololu. <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" />Godehe ido hilisebale inolo mololu. Aubale. E inolo hilisesia, ido mololu. <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />Mau ewe alefasia, <char style="w" lemma="Godene sulu dia ano">sulu dia ano</char> ilihe eloba bisigia, ainodalimo idelene guni labeba bamesine, idelehe ine guni gasiaguyo dobu.<verse eid="1CO 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />Auluso, <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilone</char> mosomu adesimo, inolo malenaga, ido elebi miliyodoluale. Aufia, ido malenaga, inolo elebi miliyodoluale. <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />Maumo, ido inolofea alefasia mololu. Aubasu, inolomo idofea alefasia seba dilo. Auluso, kegele sunia Godefea alefasia ano.<verse eid="1CO 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />Aulugulu, sulu ewe, ginemo nafuluba osolaba bamale. Idele ili Godedai sulu selesiamo, ine guni gasiagubale ligia, saeyomo isolubile? <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />Nini idele inolone mana dobu amone eweguba ulufaba walefe. Inolo ehe, ene guni alu selale gadefalunaga, amo efeamo yuaeyo besabe. <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />Auluso, ido efeamo guni alu selale gadefalunaga, ene guni alu amomo, e momada nafulu dulu labe. Maumo, Gode alefasia, guni alu selale efea melu amomo, i fagulogulu, e gasiaguba ofelesia aulu. <verse eid="1CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />Auluso, inolo nohe, sulu ewene hegesia, mau isaeyo hilisesenaga, amo ga sulu ewe nafuluba asigima. Ninida, Gode Ene <char style="w">sese</char> nonoba amoda, mana no amogulumo male. Mana ule ewesu kuliba ano.<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Saminilo asigisia, naiyo nabia mana mololomo ewe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />Aufia, aga nahe mana noolo gilifea kuliba malesi saeyobasu. Gili sese moloa gagaiyosiamo, gili mana nafulu moloyomo afasia, no anogone woba ufiyone mololo. Auba molologulu, mana gili mololu amone, nahe gili nafulu mololuba saeyale.<verse eid="1CO 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 1:10-12">1Kld 1.10-12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Maugaba na sulu ewene saeyobasu. Na dubulumo, gili <char style="w">sese</char> moloa ua gagaiyosiamo, gili aleba osolalabia daalu dobu. Inolo noolohe nafea auba selesi, dubulugulu, sulu amo sealeba wedino aulubileba asigisu. <verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" />Gine sese ogo osolafe amo, nafuluale. Auluso, nafulu wedino amo alefasia holobagamesi aufe. Enebamo, gili auba osolafe amohe, Godene hame abe kuliba aafelaba babiyone gilifea ulufaba walemesi aufe.<verse eid="1CO 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />Gili ua gagaiyosia naiyo nabiamo, gili Saminilone naiyo naasububa hilisesia naafe. Auluso, seale gili naiyo auba naafale. Aubale. <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />Maumo, gili naiyo nabiamo, noolo anogo ilida namenesi yasisiale, ogoba sisiba, samini saminiba nabia, kubaleba nolo. Ausi, noolomo waini hano wedinale nafasia kagoasi, inolo noolo naiyo difalemo, mamialo. <verse eid="1CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" />Auba molofe ogo, eneba molose? Gili naiyodai, hanodai, naiyo molo malene aufebile? Gilihe Godene sese idele inolo ewe, eleda malebusia, golaba bisigia ausela? Gelewo naiyoda male amo, ga e yuamesi ausela? Mana gili molofe ogomo, na eneba saeyobi? Gili auba molofe amone, nahe gine wi digiba saeyobile? Gili nafulu mololubamo, na saeyale koleba.<verse eid="1CO 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">
    <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo asigisia naiyo nolo">Saminilo asigisia naiyo nolone mana</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" />Na Saminilofea sulu difasia, gilifea haiba saaba melumo ewe. Saminilo Yesuda holonofeiyamo nigiliba ami, Ehe <char style="w">boledi</char> dulu. <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" />Difasia, Godefea henelu sulu saafia, Ehe boledi amo gogolesia, selesia, “Ewe Ne domalabasi. Gili sagoba ufiyone mesu. Aulugulu, gili Na asigisiamo eweguba mololabia malale.” <verse eid="1CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:6-8">Kis 24.6-8</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 8:8-13">Hib 8.8-13</ref></char></note>Auba mololu amogubamo, naiyo amo nafasiamo, Ehe waini hano gaabu wasulumo sefia ligia, selesia, “Waini hano gaabu wasulu ewe, Ne ibifea alefasia <char style="w">oloba huliale dabalu</char> hili molosu. Hilia sunia, gili waini hano wasulu amo nabiamo, Na asigisia aubasu moloba melale.” <verse eid="1CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" />Saminilo aso obegeba muluale labimo, gilihe E asigisia naiyodai hanodai naba ligiamo, E naga nafasia olalu amone, ulufaba waleba miliyobafe. Auba molobasu ligia, E saabi eloyobafe.<verse eid="1CO 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 10:29">Hib 10.29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulugulu, idele inolo abehe, Saminilone naiyodai, hano wainidai, amo nabiamo, ene manamo nafuluba uluba adesiale, naiyo balu naasuba hilisesia, naasenaga, amo ehe Saminilone domaladai, Ene ibidaifea, woba molosia, Saminilo olalumo, eleda maleba besabe. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" />Aulugulu, gili naiyodai, hanodai, aso diyo ligiamo, gine asigi ogo nafuluba osolaba bamale. <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />Idele inolo abehe, Saminilo Ene domalamo nafuluba eloba bisigiale, naiyodai, hano wainidai, amo waagi difasia naasenaga, ili heleba molofegulu, Godehe ilifeamo fadaasia osolaeyobafe. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" />Mau auba molofe amo ligia, gili aleba ugi idele inolo wedinalemo kiwidale adesia, walefa disia, noolomo daneba yaafe.<verse eid="1CO 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />Auluso, nini naiyo amo aso diyo ligia, nine asigi dale nafuluba osolafia naasenaga, amo ninimo Godehe fadaasia osolafea ami miliyo maiyobafale. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:5-6">Hib 12.5-6</ref></char></note>Auluso, Saminilohe nini osolasia, aga ninifea higinilu mesenaga, Ehe nine mana isoluale amone isomesine, aulo. Aulugulu, Ehe ninifea higinilu noolo melomo, ninimo helefealu idele inolo ewedai daba damesialefia aulo.<verse eid="1CO 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />Aulune, ne damenedali, gilihe naiyodai, hanodai, ua naiyone gagaiyosiamo, gili koleba noolo anogo ilida namenesi, aso yasiba melale. <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />Uleno ga mamiasenaga, gene moloa naiyo nafasia milale. Auba molosenaga, gili ua gagaiyosiamo, Godehe osolasia fadaayo sisa amimo, gili miliyobafale.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 11:34">Kegele noolo aso dobuso, na gili labea inigiamo, gili auba molomesisia isoyobasu.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Folohe Asubane Noekenene ulu kegele nokene nokeneba melo amone solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />Aufia, ne damenedali, na sulu kiwi nomo gilifea saeyobasu. Asubane Noekenene ulu kegele nokene nokeneba melo amone saeyobasu. Gili babeaba adosi saeyobasu. <verse eid="1CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 2:18-19">Hab 2.18-19</ref></char></note>Gili aso <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau</char> ligiamo, <char style="w">masega gode</char>, suluda sodale, amone wi digimesimo, noolohe gili eno nokene nokeneba uluba dia dedaleba alolu. Aubamo gili asigibu. <verse eid="1CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 4:2-3">1Yon 4.2-3</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, gili ewe eloba bisigia asigima. Inolo uleno, Yesufea kanolo memaba selesenaga, amo <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Godene Asubane</char> alefasia efea auba saamasi sodale. Auluso, inolo uleno, Yesu E <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminiloba</char> selesenaga, amo Asubane Noekene alefasia efea auba saamasi sodo.<verse eid="1CO 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 12:6">Lom 12.6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ulu kegelemo nokene nokeneba dobu. Auluso, ulu kegele amoda sagaba ofolaba labemo, Asubane ule E hamagasu labe. <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" />Godene dabalu moloyo nokene nokeneba dobu. Auluso, dabalu amoda molomesi gadefafe amo, Saminilo ule E hamagasu labe. <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />Dabalu molofea amimo, dabalu mololo mana nokene nokeneba dobu. Auluso, dabalu amo moloyone kiwida idele inolo suniafea mefe amo, Gode ule E hamagasu labe.<verse eid="1CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />Asubane Noekenehe idele inolo ule uleba amofea kiwi mesiamo, ulufaba melo. Ilihe noolo anogo sagoba ofa molomesifia melo.<verse eid="1CO 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />Noolofea Asubane Noekenehe asigi nafulu saaba memesine ulu melo.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="1CO 12:8">Aufia, noolofeamo, Asubane ule hamagahe, dawalolo saaba memesine ulu melo.<verse eid="1CO 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />Aufia, noolofeamo, Asubane ule hamagahe, <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> kolelu melesi mololo.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="1CO 12:9">Aufia, noolofeamo, Asubane ule hamagahe, walefalu waiba waalemesine ulu melo.<verse eid="1CO 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />Aufia, idele inolo noolofeamo, Ehe <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> molomesine ulu melo.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="1CO 12:10">Aufia, idele inolo noolofeamo, saaba ofa saamesine ulu melo.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="1CO 12:10">Aufia, idele inolo noolofeamo, asubane nonoba amone eloba bisigia osolamesifia ulu melo.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="1CO 12:10">Aufia, idele inolo noolofeamo, <char style="w" lemma="Asubanene sulu nonoba sodo">Asubanene sulu nonoba</char> saeyone dawalolo melo.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="1CO 12:10">Aufia, idele inolo noolofeamo, Asubanene sulu nonoba selefe amone kiwi sisamo sawaba besiyone dawalolo melo.<verse eid="1CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 7:7">1Kld 7.7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ulu melo suniamo, Asubane ule hamagafea alefasiasu holobagafe. Ehe, Ene hamefeguba, elebi elebibafea osolaba sagalo.<verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nini suniamo, domala ulefea haisi haisiba amone lolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 10:17">1Kld 10.17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Inolone domalamo, ule labeso, efeamo haisi haisiba wedinale labe. Haisi haisiba wedinale nonoba alebaibuso, ili sunia ua domala ule labe. Ausi, <char style="w">Keliso</char> Eda amogubasu labe. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:28">Gal 3.28</ref></char></note>Maumo, nini sunia <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano geba</char> ufuluguba, Asubane ule amone usu geba ufulu lolu. Amo alefasia, nini domala ule miliyone holobagalu. Noolomo <char style="w">Yuda</char> idele inolo, noolomo Giligi idele inolo, noolomo widale idele inolo, noolomo wida idele inolo, aufia, nini suniamo, ua domala ule lolu. Auba ligia, domala hano gefasia, domala hano kaiaba ufulu labeguba, nini sunia Asubane ulene usu geba ofelesi, Asubane ule hamagasu Efeafia kaiaba ufulu lolu.<verse eid="1CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />Nine domala ewe, haisi ule amosu holobagabuale. Aubale. Haisi wedinale nonoba kukulifia, domalamo ami moloba holobagalu dobu. <verse eid="1CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />Doma. Emo gibo selesia, “Na sone-ale. Aulugulu, domalane haisi nomo naaleba” selesiabiaga, amo e auba selefea amifia, seale domala amone haisi nomo, e adefalela? Aubale. Auba selesiabiagada, hama. Emo gibo e-mo, domalane haisi nomo, aso e labe. <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />Aufia, koneni selesia, “Na si-ale. Aulugulu, domalane haisi nomo naaleba” selesiabiaga, auba selefea amifia, seale domala amone haisi nomo, e adefalela? Aubale. Auba selesiabiagada, hama. Koneni e-mo, domalane haisi nomo, aso e labe.<verse eid="1CO 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />Nine domala ewe sunia, si elebisu alolubiaga, amo gala eneba dobaiyobi? Aufia, nine domala ewe sunia koneni elebisu alolubiaga, amo kasine eneba dobaiyobi? <verse eid="1CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />Auluso seale, nine domala amoguluale. Gode Ene asigi alefasia, domala haisi haisibamo, ili amo sunia, elebi elebiba ine dabalu koleba moloyoda dobia ami, kukuliba waalelu. <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />Domala haisi hamagulu ulenosu alolubiaga, amo domala alebaiyale. <verse eid="1CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />Auluso, aubale. Domala ule labe ewefeamo, haisi wedinale nokene nokeneba kukuliba waalebu.<verse eid="1CO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />Aulune, sihe sonefea selesiamo, “Ga malebiaga, na nelebi isoba alebaiyoba,” auba saeyobafale. Aufia, gunihe emofea selesiamo, “Ga malebiaga, na nelebi isoba alebaiyoba,” auba kolebamo saeyobafale. <verse eid="1CO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />Aubale. Nini hilisesia, nine domala haisi noolo kiwidale labeba hilisefe. Auluso, kegele amohe auba kiwidale ligia, domalafea dabalu bule mololo. Aulune, ili auba malebiaga, domala nafulu alebaiyale koleba. <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />Ninifea domala haisi noolo ewe yuaeyodolu labebuba hilisesia, abagudoa melesiale, ninihe amo haguba ofelesia, nafuluba koleba uluba ado. <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />Auluso, domala haisi ulufa bosolu ewemo, auba haguba ofelesia uluba miliyone dabalu male. Godehe domala haisi haisiba ua kukuliba waalefasia, domala haisi wida male labe amo wabialesia, wida melesi gadefalo. <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />Auba mololu amomo, nine domala ewefeamo osolaba dafalimesiale mololu. Auluso, domala haisi haisiba ninifea labe ewemo, domala haisi no anogo ine geleba, sunia ua ligia, imini ule aiba uluba melesi mololu. <verse eid="1CO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />Aulugulu, domala haisi ulenohe naga disenaga, domala haisi noolo amoda, sunia edai ua naga dife. Domala haisi uleno wida adesenaga, domala haisi noolo amoda, sunia edai ua henefe.<verse eid="1CO 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 12:5">Lom 12.5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aga gili suniamo Kelisone domala labe. Aulugulu, idele inolo ule uleba gilimo, Ene domala haisi haisiba ulenomo ga labe. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:11-12">Efe 4.11-12</ref></char></note>Amogubasu, <char style="w">sese</char> aleba ami, Godehe idele inolo ule uleba dabalu nonoba molomesi iminilu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1CO 12:28" />
  <para style="li" vid="1CO 12:28">Agelemo, Ehe noolomo <char style="w">hilibaisi daalu inolo</char> melesi iminilu.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="1CO 12:28">Aufia, aganebomo, noolo <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> melesi iminilu.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="1CO 12:28">Aufia, osolomo, noolo walelo melesi iminilu.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="1CO 12:28">Aufia, amone faisamo, <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> moloba yaalo melesi iminilu.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="1CO 12:28">Aufia, amone faisamo, walefa waiba waalelo melesi iminilu.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="1CO 12:28">Aufia noolomo, noolo anogone sagoba ofolo melesi iminilu.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="1CO 12:28">Aufia noolomo, sesene dabalu nokene nokeneba amone uluba ado melesi iminilu.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="1CO 12:28">Aufia, Ehe idele inolo noolomo <char style="w" lemma="Asubanene sulu nonoba sodo">Asubanene sulu nonoba</char> samesi iminilu.<verse eid="1CO 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />Sese aleba amimo, idele inolo sunia hilibaisi daalu labebile? Sunia saaba ofolo labebile? Sunia walelo labebile? Sunia momolelu kegele mololo labebile? <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />Sunia walefalu waiba ufiyone dawalolo melu labebile? Sunia Asubanene sulu nonoba sodo labebile? Sunia sulu amone kiwi sisamo sawaba besilo labebile? Aubale. Suniahe dabalu ene eneba moloyo dobu. <verse eid="1CO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 14:1">1Kld 14.1</ref></char></note>Aulune, gilihe dabalu molosiamo, Asubane Noekenene ulu kegele saminiba waalebu amone difasia, dabalu moloyone migagaba malale.<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="rem">z1col-s</para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Hameselo amohe mana noolomo suniafia wasolu dobu</para>
  <para style="p">Doma. Mana nafulu ulenohe, noolomo sunialu saminiba dobu amone, nahe gilifea waleyobasu.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />Na helefealu idele inolone sulu nokene nokeneba isoba waagi selesenagada,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1CO 13:1">aufia <char style="w" lemma="Godene sulu dia ano">Godene sulu dia anone</char> sulu amoda isoba waagi selesenagada,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CO 13:1">auluso, nafea hameselo mana malenaga, na belo balu fuusi, ilibo masega galaloguba galafe.<verse eid="1CO 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 17:20">Mad 17.20</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Saaba ofolone dawalolomo nafea ligia, nahe kegele mugusilu dobumo sunia fadaba asigilu lolunagada,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1CO 13:2">nahe kegele sunia dawaloba dulu lolunagada,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CO 13:2">auluso nafea hameselo mana malenaga, amo na balu eleda male lolu.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1CO 13:2">Seale, nahe <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> kolelu adesia, hele galefea gigilimasi, gale amo gigilisenagada,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CO 13:2">auluso nafea hameselo mana malenaga, amoda na balu eleda male koleba lolu.<verse eid="1CO 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />Nahe ne kegele sunia weagulu idele inolofea sagaba samodosenagada,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1CO 13:3">aufia nahe no anogo sagoba ofaiyesia, ne domalamo de waiya usu waagi dafogomasi weasesenagada,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CO 13:3">auluso nafea hameselo mana malenaga, na mololu amohe, na sagoba ofelesiale, balu weasefe.<verse eid="1CO 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />Hameselo e-mo hamedofa esebalo ado.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="1CO 13:4">Hameselo ehe mana nafulu heafuba mololo.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="1CO 13:4">Hameselo ehe no anogofea haboba hiliselale.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="1CO 13:4">Ehe bamabamaba adale.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="1CO 13:4">Ehe elelilale.<verse eid="1CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" />Ehe no anogo woba ofolale.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="1CO 13:5">Ehe ene meleba hiliselale.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="1CO 13:5">Ehe alebale hegelale.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="1CO 13:5">Noolohe efea heleba molofemo, ehe sabeyo hiliselale.<verse eid="1CO 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 12:9">Lom 12.9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ehe mana isoluale molofe amo bisigiamo, henelale.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="1CO 13:6">Aubale, ehe seale sodofea henelo.<verse eid="1CO 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 4:8">1Fid 4.8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ehe sunia hagugubasu ado.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="1CO 13:7">Ehe sigiba dobolabasu ado.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="1CO 13:7">Ehe <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofelagofia yasifiasu</char> ado.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="1CO 13:7">Ehe afelesiale kalugaafia, daabasu ado.<verse eid="1CO 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />Hameselo mana, e koleba asigileyobafale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 13:8">Auluso, saaba ofa sodomo asigileyobafe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 13:8">
    <char style="w" lemma="Asubanene sulu nonoba sodo">Asubanene sulu nonoba</char> sodo mana amoda asigileyobafe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 13:8">Inolone asigiloda dulu sunia amoda asigileyobafe.<verse eid="1CO 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />Enebamo, asigilo nini aga dulumo, haisi haisibasu dulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 13:9">Aufia, aga nini saaba ofa selesiamo, nini haisi haisibasu selaba lolu.<verse eid="1CO 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />Auluso, dufiamo, kegele suniada moloba samodoyo hilia amo adesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 13:10">haisi haisiba mololo mana amo afiyobafe.<verse eid="1CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />Ewemo, faibe bulelo mana amogulu adefe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 13:11">Na faibe wedino aso ligiamo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 13:11">na-mo faibe deseine molologuba mololo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 13:11">Aufia, ne asigida, ne sulu sododa, ne asigiloda, na boloda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 13:11">faibe deseine molologuba moloba alolu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 13:11">Aga na bulefasia, inolo adesiamo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 13:11">faibe deseinene manamo sunia afolu.<verse eid="1CO 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" />Aga ninihe Godene kegelemo haisi haisibasu asigibu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 13:12">Nini hewofea fufuneba bolo amoguba bisigia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 13:12">sunia fadaba aso bosoluale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 13:12">Auluso, dufia, ninihe seale si galiba, mi gagiba bisigiamo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 13:12">ninihe E nafuluba fadaba babiyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 13:12">Aga na aso E haisi haisiba asigiba lolu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 13:12">Godehe na aga asigiba samodofeguba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 13:12">dufiada nahe E asigiba samodoyo.<verse eid="1CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TH 1:3">1Des 1.3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulugulu, mana osoloa ewemo ufiasu miliyobafe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="1CO 13:13">Asigi ule ufiyo manada,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="1CO 13:13">
    <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">Hame diba ofelagofia yasiba</char> miliyo manada,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="1CO 13:13">Aufia, hameselo manada,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="1CO 13:13">Mana osoloa amo ufiasu miliyobafe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="1CO 13:13">Auluso, mana osoloa amone olaibomo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="1CO 13:13">hameselo mana koleba.<verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="rem">z1col-e</para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="s">Asubanene ulu kegele melo amone sulu noolomo ewe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 12:31">1Kld 12.31</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 14:39">14.39</ref></char>
    </note>Aulugulu, hameselone mana kuliba maiyo eno amone migagaba dedaleba melale. Aufia, Asubanene ulu kegele ninifea mefe amone diyone migagaba dedaleba melale. Ulu kegele sunia amone aleba amimo, saaba ofa saeyo amone dawalolo diyone koleba asigimale. <verse eid="1CO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />Idele inolo abehe, <char style="w" lemma="Asubanene sulu nonoba sodo">Asubanene sulu nonoba</char> selesenaga, amo idele inolo domesine selefale. Aubale. Ilihe Gode domesine selefe. Maumo, ulenohe sulu auba selefe amo fadaba diyobafale. Aubale. Ilihe Asubane alefasia, mugusilu dobu amone selefe. <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />Auluso, idele inolo abehe, saaba ofa selesenaga, ili amo idele inolo domesine selefe. Ili amohe kiwigaaba ofelesia, mana nafulu molomesi degeba ofa selefe. Aufia, ilihe idele inolone libo heheneba ofelesia selefe. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />Idele inolo abehe, Asubanene sulu nonoba selesenaga, amo ilihe ine meleba asigi ule ufulu amone kiwigaaba ofelefe. Auluso, idele inolo abehe, saaba ofa selefemo, <char style="w">sese</char> idele inolo suniane asigi ule waalebu amone kiwigaaba ofa selefe. <verse eid="1CO 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" />Gili sunia Asubanene sulu nonoba saamalebaiyeba hamefe. Auluso, olaibo kegele na hamefemo, amo ewe, gili sunia saaba ofa saamalebaiyeba hamefe. Maumo, saaba ofa sodo ehe, Asubanene sulu sodomo wasolu. Auluso, Asubanene suluda selefe amo ehe, sulu amone kiwi sisa amoda sawaba besisenaga, amo e saaba ofolodai imini ule miliyobafe. Maumo, ehe auba ausia, sese idele inolomo kiwigaaba ufiyobafe.<verse eid="1CO 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />Ne damenedali, doma. Na gili labea milifasiamo, Asubanene sulusu selaba adesenaga, amohe gilifea halaguba sagoba ufiyobafe? Amohe sagoba ufiyobafale. Auluso, na gili labea ligiamo, nahe gilifea sulu muguba ufulu ulufaba selesenaga, me gilifea asigilo nafulu mesenaga, me gilifea sulu saaba ofa selesenaga, me gilifea molomesi sulu walesenaga, amohe gili sagoba ufiyobafe.<verse eid="1CO 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />Miliyoluda male gala galalo kegele amone dedeba selesu. Ulenohe baidame, me gida kegele amogulu dufelesiaso, kegele amo gala wangi nonoba malenaga, idele inolohe gasa halane selefebiba eloba dubiyobafale. <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />Aufia, belo fuusi, amone gala wangi nafuluba koleba dobelesalenaga, idele inolomo gagaiyobafale. <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />Galalo kegele amofea dedeba selesumo, amoguba gilifeada auba holobagalo. Gilihe Asubanene sulu idele inolo eloba dubiyodolualemone selesenaga, sulu gili selefe amone sisamo, idele inolohe asigiba diyobafale koleba. Sulu gili selefe amo balu weaseyobafe.<verse eid="1CO 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />Helefealu iwimo, sulu sodo nokene nokeneba saludiale waalebu. Aufia, sulu sodo sunia amimo, sulu kiwi sisa ene eneba dobu. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />Auluso, hele nolobalone sulu amone kiwi sisa na asigilualenaga, inolo sulu amoda selefe ogo, bolale inolobuba asigilo. Ausi, e-moda na bolale inolobuba asigilo. <verse eid="1CO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />Amogubasu, gili sese aleba ami, inolo uleno sulu gili dobolalemo selesenaga, sulu amohe sese kiwigaaba ufiyobafale. Aulugulu, gili eweguba migagaba malale. Gili Asubanene ulu kegele dibaiyeba hilisesia, ulu kegele sese mosomufea kiwigaaba ofolo amone difasia, helegeba moloba melale.<verse eid="1CO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folohe Asubanene sulu nokene nokeneba sodo amone solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />Aulune, uleno abehe <char style="w" lemma="Asubanene sulu nonoba sodo">Asubanene sulu nonoba</char> selesenaga, amo sulu kiwi sisa amone sawaba besiyone efea dawalolo memesi, Godedai sulu saamale. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />Gili asigima. Na Godedai sulu selesiamo, Asubanene suluba selesenaga, amo ne asubanemo Godedai sulu selefe. Auluso, ne asigimo, balu labe. <verse eid="1CO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" />Aulugulu, na eneba moloyobi? Ne asubanehe Godedai sulu selesimo, ne asigi amoda Godedai sulu saeyo dobu. Aufia, ne asubanehe Efea gasa selesimo, ne asigi amoda gasa saeyo dobu. <verse eid="1CO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />Gahe ge asigida molosiale, ge asubanesu Godefea henelu sulu selesenaga, inolo uleno ga suluda selefea ami ligia, dobolaba labe ogo, ga selefemo asigiba difalene, ehe sulu ga selefe ogo eneba eesia, “<char style="sls"><char style="w">Amen</char></char>, amo sealeba” saeyobafebi? <verse eid="1CO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />Ga ge asubane alefasia, Godefea henelu sulu selesenaga, amo woluale. Aubale. Amo nafulu. Auluso, sulu ga auba selefe amohe, idele inolo noolo anogo kiwigaaba ufiyobafale.<verse eid="1CO 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />Nahe Godefea henelu sulu selesu, maumo, hilia wedinalemo nahe Asubanene sulu nonoba sodo. Na mana amo mololo amohe, gili sunia wasolu koleba. <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />Auluso, <char style="w">sese</char> aleba ami, na idele inolo waleyosia, Asubanene sulu nonoba saludiale selesenaga, amo nafuluale koleba. Aubale. Nahe ne asigi alefasia, ilifea sulu saaba mesenaga, amo nafulu. Seale, sulu wedino asigi alefasia selefe amohe, Asubanene sulu saludiale selefemo wasolu labe.<verse eid="1CO 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 4:14">Efe 4.14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ne damenedali, gine asigilofealomo, gilimo faibe deseinegulu melabiyo. Auluso, wolu moloyofealomo, gili faibe subobogulu melale. Auluso, gine asigimo, faibe deseine asigiloguba asigife amo afasia, asidalune asigi dulu melale. <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:11-12">Ais 28.11-12</ref></char></note>Godene bugomo, eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1CO 14:21" />
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">
    <char style="qt">“<char style="w">Saminilo</char> selesia, ‘Sulu nokene nokeneba sodo idele inolone mofeyofea alefasia, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">
    <char style="qt">Nahe Ne mosomufea saeyobasu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, bolale idele inolone mofeyofea alefasia, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">
    <char style="qt">Nahe Ne mosomufea saeyobasu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">
    <char style="qt">Auluso, ilihe Na sulu auba selefe amoda nafuluba sigiba dubiyobafale.’ ”</char><verse eid="1CO 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />Aulugulu, Asubanene sulu sodo manamo, <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi uleda ufulu</char> idele inolo Godene kiwi eloba bamesine, iminiluale. Aubale. Mana amomo, asigi uleda ufuluale idele inolo eloba bamesine iminilu. Auluso, saaba ofa sodo manamo, Godehe asigi uleda ufuluale idele inolo ineba iminilualeso, asigi uleda ufulu ineba iminilu. <verse eid="1CO 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:13">HD 2.13</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, asigi ule ufulu idele inolo gilimo, sese moloa ami gagaiyofia, Asubanene sulu nonoba selaba labi, asigi ule ufuluale idele inolo gine manada babealu labe ilimo, gili gagaiyobia ami milibaifasia, sulu auba selefemo dobelesenaga, amo ilihe gili elawanefebileba saeyobafe. <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 16:8">Yon 16.8</ref></char></note>Auluso, gili sunia saaba ofa selaba labi, asigi ule ufuluale idele inolo gili gagaiyobia ami esenaga, sulu gili selefemohe ine libo odesi, ili wolu mololo idele inolo lolububa eloba hiliseyobafe. <verse eid="1CO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25" />Aufia, ine asigihe muguba ufulumo sunia ulufa diba ofelesi, ilimo emo hugulumo sagafia yoba sigia, Godene wi digisia, gilifea selesia, “Seale, Godemo gili aleba iwi labeba” saeyobafe.<verse eid="1CO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gulugulusiamo, mana nafulu muulu amone kuliba malale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 12:8-10">1Kld 12.8-10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulugulu, ne damenedali, gili Godefea guluguluyone ua gagaiyosiamo, eneba moloyo? Gili ua gagaiyofiamo, eweguba molomale.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1CO 14:26" />
  <para style="li" vid="1CO 14:26">Noolohe gasa saeyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="1CO 14:26">Noolomo, molomesi sulu waleba saeyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="1CO 14:26">Noolomo, sulu Godehe efea ulufaba walefe amone saeyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="1CO 14:26">Noolomo, Asubanene sulu saeyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="1CO 14:26">Noolomo, Asubanene sulu selefe amone besisia, sawaba saeyobafe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1CO 14:26" />
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 14:26">Kegele sunia moloyobafe amohe, sese idele inolofea kiwigaaba ufiyone moloyo dobu. <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />Sese gagaiyofia gulugulufea ami, idele inolo noolohe, Asubanene sulu saeyo hamesenaga, inolo aidabile, me osoloabile amosu saamale. Ili sulu amo selesiamo, imini ule aiba samabiyo. No saafia sausi, no saeyoba saamale. Ausi, sulu ili selefe amomo, ulenohe besisiamo sawaba saamale. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />Asubanene sulu selefe amone sawaba besiyo inolo uleno malenaga, amo <char style="w">sese</char> usu ami, gili Asubanene sulu selesiale, saumale. Auluso, ga gelebi ligia, Asubanene sulu selesiamo, Godefeasu selesenaga, amo nafulu.<verse eid="1CO 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TH 5:21">1Des 5.21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Saaba ofa sodo idele inolo aidabile, me osoloabile, sulu waagi saaba ofa samesi gadefamale. Aufia noolomo, sulu ili selefe amone nafuluba osolaba domale. <verse eid="1CO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />Auluso, inolo ulenohe saaba ofa selaba labimo, Godene Asubanehe inolo no ami yoba saabe amofea, sulu hili no walesimo, ehe sulu amo waleyo asigisenaga, inolo samini suluda waleba alolu ga-mo, sulu sausia, efea fogo memale. <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />Ausimo, gili ule ulebahe saaba ofa sulu elebi elebiba samesi fogo mesi, selefe mana amo alefasia, gili sunia asigilo disia, asigi ule ufulumo kiwigaaba ofolaba miliyobafe. <verse eid="1CO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />Sulu <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> amohe, ili sulu imini ule aiba sodosi, ine mofeyo uluba miliyo dobu. <verse eid="1CO 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33" />Maumo, Gode E suguba dafalilo mana kuliba anale. Aubale. E esebalo <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aeaba</char> muulu melesi moloba ofolo Gode labe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">
    <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Muuba kalilu idele inolo</char> ine sese sunia ami, guluguluyone gagaiyofia molologuba, <verse eid="1CO 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 11:3">1Kld 11.3</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 2:12">1Dim 2.12</ref></char></note> gine idele ilida, gili sese gagaiyobia ami sulu samabiyo. Aubale. Mosesehe sulu <char style="w">muguli</char> saaba ufulu amoguba, ili helea adesia, sulu saufia melale. <verse eid="1CO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />Idele ilihe sulu uleno amone mau fadaba dubiyo hilisesenaga, ine moloa daafia yoba sigia, ine ainofea doba bamale. Maumo, sese gagaiyobia ami, idelehe sulu selesenaga, amo nafulu besabalegulu, yuaeyo dobu.<verse eid="1CO 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />Wae, Kolidi gili, Godene sulu gilifeafia maugalubile? Gode Ene sulu amo gili labeasu holobagalubile? Aubale. <verse eid="1CO 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 4:6">1Yon 4.6</ref></char></note> Gili aleba ugi uleno hilisesia, “Na saaba ofolo inolo loluba,” me “Na Godene Asubaneda alolu inolo noekene loluba,” ene meleba auba saaba selesenaga, inolo amo ga eweguba hilisema. “Sulu saabia lagi, Folo aga seleba melu ewe, sulu balumone dobuale. Aubale. Saminilo alefasia molomaleba solu sulu amone dobu.” Auba hiliseba mela. <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />Auluso, inolo uleno Saminilone molomaleba solu sulu waaselaba besenaga, amo gili koleba eda waaselaba bisigia, e-mo saaba ofolo inologulu bamabiyo.<verse eid="1CO 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />Ne damenedali, gilihe saaba ofa saeyomo bule hamemale. Aufia, gilihe Asubanene sulu saeyomo kaamabiyo. <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" />Auluso, sese usu amimo, gilihe kegele sunia molosiamo, suguba dafalilale ligia, mana nafulu muulu amone kuliba abia moloba melale.<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="s">Keliso E olafasia haiba degelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />Ne damenedali, sulu na gilifea aga walesumo, amo Awalu Sulu Nafulu, na gilifea samini awaba melu hamagane walesu. Awalu sulu nafulu amo dobelesia, gili dulumo, aga amone saabia kalugaafia alebaibu. <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />Awalu Sulu Nafulu amofea alefasia, gili <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba obegeba dulu</char> labe. Auluso, gilihe sulu amo, na gilifea saaba melugulu, fedoba sefia adesalenaga, amo gili balu <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> besabe.<verse eid="1CO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:5-12">Ais 53.5-12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kegele na gilifea saaba melumo, na nene asigiluale. Aubale. Noolo selesi, na dobelesia dulu. Sulu amone olaibo amo ewe. Samini Godene bugohe sulu seleba ufulu amo wakaliba sugasia, <char style="w">Keliso</char> E-mo nine <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolune</char> olaluso. <verse eid="1CO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:40">Mad 12.40</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 2:24-32">HD 2.24-32</ref></char></note>E olasi, ilihe E baliba ufuluso. Hilia osolomo, E <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeba ifoluso</char>. Auba ausimo, Godene bugo sulu seleba ufulumo wakaliba sugalu.<verse eid="1CO 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 24:34">Lug 24.34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 28:16-17">Mad 28.16-17</ref></char>
    </note>Keliso E degefasia abiamo, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Sifase</char> labea holobagaluso.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1CO 15:5">Dufiamo, Ene walelu faibili huguluba kakainabia ami goaluso.<verse eid="1CO 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />Amone faisamo, Eda kuliba dedaleba alolu idele inolo fula bia (500) amogulu sunialu amo, ilihe hilia ule hamaga, E-mo ilifaba ua abuluso. Idele inolo fogo ami, Eda abulu ili amone, bule wedinale aso bebea alebaibiyo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Folo sulu kiwi solumo, ewe. Seale, Yesu E olafasia, degelu abulumo, idele inolo noolo ine si abulu. Amone solu. Aulugulu, Yesu degeluba solu amo, sadalu balu soluale. Idele inolo hilia ami E-da abulumo, Folo sowi ewe seleiya fogo ami, wedinale noolo aso olaluale alebaibuba solu.</char></note> Auluso, bilale noolo olalubiyo.<verse eid="1CO 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 1:3-4">HD 1.3-4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>E <char style="w" lemma="Yemese[[3]], Yemese Bugoda selelumo, amo e">Yemese</char> labea holobagafia, aufia <char style="w" lemma="Hilibaisi daalu inolo">hilibaisi daalu</char> ili sunia labea ami holobagaluso.<verse eid="1CO 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 9:3-6">HD 9.3-6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ili abulu amone sunia faisa koleba, elosiamo, E na labea holobagaso. Faibe seelelu seba dulu amogulu, eleda male kolebamo, amo na.<verse eid="1CO 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 3:8">Efe 3.8</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 1:15">1Dim 1.15</ref></char>
    </note>Na nene meleba auba saaba selesumo, mau ewe. Na Godene <char style="w">sese</char> idele inolo elasabiasia, naga meba yaalumone, hilibaisi daalu inolo aleba ami, sia ageledenomo, na lolu. Seale, hilibaisi daalu inoloba saeyo wi amo, nafea saeyomo ilililuale koleba lolu. <verse eid="1CO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:23">2Kld 11.23</ref></char></note>Auluso, Godehe nafea kanuluba ufulu amo alefasia, na aga adesumo, amo lolu. Seale, Gode Ene <char style="w">kanululo</char> nafea melu amomo, balu weaseluale. Aubale, amo sebe helelu. Dabalu kolelu na mololu amo alefasia, hilibaisi daalu inolo noolo ili mololumo sunialu. Auluso, dabalu amo ne-ale. Godehe nafea kanuluba ufulu amo alefasia, dabalu ewe na molosu. <verse eid="1CO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />Aulugulu, dabalu amo na mololunagada, hilibaisi daalu inolo noolo ili mololunagada, amo isolu. Ninihe sulu nafulu uluse amosu walelogulu, gilihe sulu amofea asigi ule ufulu.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Idele inolo danelumo haiba degeba ifoyobafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />Nini sulu mana walesiamo, “Keliso E olafasia, daneba yaalu waalebiafia degeba ifoluba” waleba lolu. Aulugulu, gili noolo selesia, “Idele inolo danelumo <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeyobafaleba</char>” selefe ogomo, enesi selese?<verse eid="1CO 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />Idele inolo daneba yaalu ilimo haiba degelalebiaga,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CO 15:13">amo Keliso Eda haiba degeba ifoyodoluale alebaiyo.<verse eid="1CO 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />Aufia, Keliso E haiba degeba ifolualebiaga,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CO 15:14">awalu sulu nafulu nini walesu ewe, eleda male adesia, gili <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> amoda eleda male alebaiyo.<verse eid="1CO 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />Auba ausiabiaga,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CO 15:15">ninihe Gode mololu amone walesiamo, nini masega sulu sodo inolo alebaiyo.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CO 15:15">Auba selesumo mau ewe. Ninimo Godehe Keliso E haiba degeba ifolubamo fadaba waleba alolu. Auluso, danelu ilimo haiba degeba ifolaleba solu sulu amo, sealebiaga, amo ninimoda Gode Ehe Keliso haiba degeba ifolualebiyoba saeyodolu alebaiyo.<verse eid="1CO 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" />Enebamo, idele inolo danelumo haiba degeba ifoyalebiaga,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CO 15:16">amo Godehe Keliso E-da haiba degeba ifobaiyale.<verse eid="1CO 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />Aufia, Godehe Keliso E-mo haiba degeba ifolualebiaga,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CO 15:17">asigi ule gili ufulu ogo, eleda male adesia, gili sububa dafelagoluale ligia, aso <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> mololo mana sisa adabia daaba alebaiyo.<verse eid="1CO 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />Aufia, idele inolo Kelisodai kulifia ligia, haneba kalofia alebaibu ilimo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Haneba kalofia alebaibu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">selefe amo, daneba yaaluba iminiba selefe. Sigidubulu idele inolo danelu amo, haneba kalofia ligia, degeba gaeyo hilia yasife.</char></note> seale, daaba dafalilu alebaiyo.<verse eid="1CO 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />Yesu degeba ifolualebiaga,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CO 15:19">amo nini olafia labi, Ehe nini sagoba ufiyodoluale alebaiyo.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1CO 15:19">Aulugulu, ninimo helefealu iwi bebea ado mana amonesu Kelisofea <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofelagofia yasisiabiaga</char>,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CO 15:19">amo yeeleba sodo idele inolo ili aleba ami, ninimo olaibo koleba alebaiyo.<verse eid="1CO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />Auluso aga aubale. Keliso daneba yaalu dobiafia seale haiba degeba ifolu koleba labe. <char style="w">Sebe olaibo</char> suloguba, E daneba yaalu dobiafia degeba ifolu. Aufia, E degeba ifoluguba, daneba yaalu ili noolo amoda aubasu degeba yaeyobafe. <verse eid="1CO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:12">Lom 5.12</ref></char></note>Maumo, olaeyo manamo, inolo ulefea alefasia, helefealu iwi dibia holobagalu. Amogubasu, daneba yaalu ili amo haiba degeba ifoyo mana amoda, inolo ulefea alefasia dibia holobagalu.<verse eid="1CO 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Adama">Adamafeamo</char>, idele inolo sunia danelo. Auluso, Kelisofeamo, idele inolo sunia bebea alebaimesi moloyobafe. <verse eid="1CO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 4:16">1Des 4.16</ref>; <ref loc="REV 20:5">MUU 20.5</ref></char></note>Auluso, ule uleba amone faisa faisaba degeba yaeyobafe. Sebe olaibomo, Keliso amo E. Godehe Edale haiba bebea melesi mololu. E faisa alefasia, idele inolo Keliso Ene koleba alebaibu ili amo, E obegeba saabi, haiba bebea alebaimesi moloyobafe.<verse eid="1CO 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" />Amone faisa amimo, aleba eloyo hiliamo ami holobagaeyobafe. Amimo, Kelisohe, kaamo adesia, yasilo suniada, wida solu suniada, kiwigagalu selu suniada, woba dafiyobafe. Aufia, Ehe kegele E yasifia uluba alolu amo sunia Enao Godene sone saabia ofelesia, Efea meyobafe. <verse eid="1CO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:44">Mad 22.44</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sng 110.1</ref></char></note> Mau enebamo, Godehe Yesune gisa suniamo Ene emo sisa aso diba ofale labi, Keliso E kini ligia, yasifia uluba adabia daabasu miliyobafe. <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 20:14">MUU 20.14</ref></char></note> Ene gisa elosia bidiba dafelesiamo, Ehe olalo amone bidiba dafiyobafe.<verse eid="1CO 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 8:6">Sng 8.6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Maumo, Godene bugohe eweguba selelu dobu. “<char style="qt">Godehe kegele suniamo, E uluba ligia yasimesi, Ene emo sisa diba ufulu.</char>” Bama. “Kegele suniamo Ene emo sisa diba ufuluba” seleba ufulu dobiyo. Auluso, kegele sunia-da Yesu Keliso sisa diba ufulu Gode amo Ehe, Ene E-mo, kegele sunia diba ufuluiya ami, gegoaba ufuluba seleba ufulualebiyo. Aubale. Ene E-mo, ami gegoaba ufulualebiyo. <verse eid="1CO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />Aulune, kegele sunia Efea yasifia uluba melesi, Ene emo sisa diba waalelu dobi, Faibehe Ene meleba Enao sisa melesi gadefaeyobafe. Maugabamo, Enaohe kegele sunia Ene Faibene emo sisa diba ufuluso, Faibe Ene meleba Enao sisa diba ofelesi, Gode E ana adesia, kegele suniane guni ligia, kegele suniane usu miliyobafe.<verse eid="1CO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />Sigidubulu idele inolo noolo mana eweguba mololo dobiyo. Inolo uleno <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano gebale</char> olasi, ene damene nohe, olalu amone wi saabia hano gelo. Auluso, danelu idele inolo ili amo haiba obegeba degeba ifoyalebiaga, amo olalune wi saabia hano gelo mana ogomo, mauda male ligia, danelu ilifea sagoba ofaiyale koleba.<verse eid="1CO 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.30 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 8:36">Lom 8.36</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, hilibaisi daalu inolo ninimo, awalu sulu nafulu walelabia sisu amofea alefasia, hilia sunia higinilu nokene nokeneba bule koleba beabia siba lolu. Auluso, danelumo haiba degeyalebiaga, ninimo eneyone awalu sulu amo walelabia sisubi? Ausiabiaga, amo waleyone mau malegulu, nini amo afaiyo. <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" />Auluso, higinilu ogo nini balu bosoluale. Ne damenedali, nini sunia <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Yesu Kelisofea adesimo, na gilifea bule koleba henelugulu, sulu gilifea solumo, seale selesu amo ewe. Hilia sunia na higinilu disiamo, olaeyodolugulu alolu. <verse eid="1CO 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 22:13">Ais 22.13</ref></char></note>Na Efesa dauno iwi labimo, gamane ilihe na olamesi naga mesia, nafea selibo gesodai belagumaba selesi, na-mo olalu haiba degeba ifoyobafeba asigi ule ufulualebiaga, selibo gesodai belaguyo amo eleda male alebaiyo. Danelu haiba degesialebiaga, nini eweguba sabaiyo.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1CO 15:32" />
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 15:32">
    <char style="qt">“Ninimo, helefealu iwine idele inolo ligia, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 15:32">
    <char style="qt">aidemo olaeyobafegulu, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 15:32">
    <char style="qt">aga yagi, nini heneba ligia naiyodai, hanodai, naasenaga, amo nafulu.” </char><verse eid="1CO 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />Sulu amogulumohe, gilimo sigiba dibia eno heleba malesi melabiyo. Maumo, “Wolu mololo amodai ua sesamaba adomohe, mana nafulu mololo ili amo medelo.”  <verse eid="1CO 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />Aulugulu, babeaba asigife amo afasia, mana isolu amo hilisesiamo, gili wolu molobasu labe ogo hama. Idele inolo noolo gili aleba ami, aso Gode asigiluale alebaibu. Gili yuaba ofelesia, sulu ewe ami selesu.<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Olalu haiba degefe domala amomo nokene miliyobafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />Auluso, inolo uleno doba bisigia selesia, “Daneba yaalu ogo halaguba degeba yaeyobafebi? Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degesimo</char>, ine domalamo halagulu babiyobafebi?” <verse eid="1CO 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:24">Yon 12.24</ref></char></note>Inolo auba doba besabe ga-mo, ga asigiba difale koleba! Sebe gili gine geiya gelo amo, hele usu gesi, belaba disia olalo. Aufasia, haiba miliyolu disia, sobosia, kau hilimo holobagaeyobafe. Auluso, amo belaba disia olasalenaga, e haiba miliyolu diyobafale koleba. <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />Gahe goali gesimo, goali i dufia soboyobafe amogulu ga gelale. Aubale. Goali sebe balu amosu, ga gelo. <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" />Sebe nonoba amofeafia Godehe i nonoba sobomesine gadefalo. Ehe Ene hamefeguba, i ule ulebahe ene mimisililu ene hamagulu koleba holobagamesi gadefalo. <verse eid="1CO 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />Helefealu iwi kakainabu suniane domalamo, sunia ule aibale. Inolone domalamo no. Aufia, kelebulune domalamo no. Aufia, hagane domalamo no. Aufia, hanine domalamo no. <verse eid="1CO 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />Helefealu iwida, anakiwi lagida, kegele nonoba amo domala nonoba waalebu. Kegele anakiwi lagi ufulu alebaibumo, ine domalane <char style="w" lemma="Elalelu">elalelumo</char> no bolo. Aufia, helefealune kegelemo, ine domalane elalelumo no bolo. <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />Seale, halone nee elalelumo no bolo, aubedai, sigabidai amone nee elalelumo no bolo. Sigabi ulenone nee elalelumo no, sigabi nomone nee elalelumo no bolo.<verse eid="1CO 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />Daneba yaalu ili <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeyobafemo</char> amogubasu moloyobafe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1CO 15:42" />
  <para style="li1" vid="1CO 15:42">Olalu domalamo, sebe geloguba, belaba dila iligi baliba ofelefeso,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CO 15:42">belaba dilale dobia ami, haiba degeba ifoyobafe.<verse eid="1CO 15:42" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.43 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PHP 3:20-21">Fil 3.20-21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Olalu domalamo, sebe geloguba, widale, golaba bolo dobia iligi baliba ofelefeso,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CO 15:43">wida <char style="w">elalelu</char> dobia ami, haiba degeba ifoyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1CO 15:43">Olalu domalamo, kiwi saneiya iligi geba ofelefeso,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CO 15:43">kiwigagaiya ami, haiba degeba ifoyobafe.<verse eid="1CO 15:43" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />Olalu domala hele iligi geba ofolo amo, helefealune bado amone domala.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CO 15:44">Domala haiba obegeba degeyobafe amo, Asubane amone domala miliyobafe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1CO 15:44" />
  <para style="li1" vid="1CO 15:44">Asigima. Helefealune bado amone domala labenaga,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CO 15:44">amo Asubanene domala amoda labe.<verse eid="1CO 15:44" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.45 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 2:7">Stt 2.7</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Godene bugo usu eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1CO 15:45" />
  <para style="li1" vid="1CO 15:45">
    <char style="qt">Inolo <char style="w">Adama</char> maugaba mulu amo, e bebea miliyone domala holobagalu.</char></para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CO 15:45">Auluso, elosia mulu Adama Ehe, bebea melesi meyone asubane holobagalu.<verse eid="1CO 15:45" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />Asubanene domala amodale maugaba holobagaluale. Aubale.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1CO 15:46">Helefealu badone domala amodale maugaba holobagalu.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CO 15:46">Aufia dufiamo, Asubanene domala amone holobagaeyobafe.<verse eid="1CO 15:46" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" />Inolo maugaba holobagalu amo, e hele saofeafia moloba dafelagolu alolu.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CO 15:47">Inolo dufia holobagalumo, <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">hebenefia</char> mulu.<verse eid="1CO 15:47" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />Hele sao idele inolomo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1CO 15:48">hele saofeafia mololu inolo waagulu alebaibu.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CO 15:48">Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">hebenene</char> ili amo,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CO 15:48">hebenefia mulu inolo waagulu alebaibu.<verse eid="1CO 15:48" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />Nini hele saofeafia holobagalu amone mimisililu waagulu aloluguba,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="1CO 15:49">nini dufia hebenefia mulu amone mimisililu amoda waagulu miliyobasu.<verse eid="1CO 15:49" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />Ne damenedali, nahe gilifea seale koleba ulufaba fadaba selesu. Helefealune huudai, ibidai, ewehe, Godene Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamone daalo diyodoluale koleba dobu. Aufia, nine belaba dilo domalamohe, belaba dilalene daalo diyodoluale dobu. <verse eid="1CO 15:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:31">Mad 24.31</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 4:15-17">1Des 4.15-17</ref></char></note>Gili doma. Mugusilu ule dobumo, nahe gilifea sawaba selesu. Nini aleba ami, sunia olaeyobafale. Auluso, olalunagada, me aso olalualenagada, nini sunia haiba dedegeba ufiyobafe. <verse eid="1CO 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52" />Elosia belo fuusimo, si alu olabologuba alebale hamagi, danelu idele inolo ili amo, sunia belaba dilale adesia, haiba degeba ifoyobafe. Ausimo, Godehe nini sunia haiba dedegesia, domala no melesi moloba waaleyobafe. <verse eid="1CO 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.53 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:4">2Kld 5.4</ref></char></note>Amo eweguba. Belaba dilo huba dafasia, belaba dilale kaeyobafe. Olalo huba dafasia, olalale kaeyobafe. <verse eid="1CO 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.54 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 25:8">Ais 25.8</ref></char></note> Belaba dilo badomo huba dafasia, belaba dilale badomo kaaba ufulu labida, olalo huba dafasia, olalale kaaba ufulu labida, fogo ami, Godene sulu selelu dobu ewe, seale koleba ililiyobafe. Sulu amo ewe. <char style="qt">“Kaamo alolu amohe, olalomo gulubaisia, naba samodolu.”</char><verse eid="1CO 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.55 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 13:14">Hos 13.14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="qt">Olalo-ooo, ge kaamo hala?</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 15:55">
    <char style="qt">Olalo-ooo, ge yalo hala?</char><verse eid="1CO 15:55" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.56 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 7:13">Lom 7.13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Olalone yalomo, <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> mololo mana amo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 15:56">Aufia, wolu mololo mana amone kiwigagalumo sulu <char style="w" lemma="Muguli">mugulifeafia</char> dilo.<verse eid="1CO 15:56" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />Auluso, nini Godefea henema.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 15:57">Nine Saminilo Yesu Kelisofea alefasia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 15:57">Godehe nini kiwigaaba ofelesi, nini kaamo adofealo lolu.<verse eid="1CO 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />Aulugulu, ne damenedali, ne yagusodali gili, kegele ulenohe gili gigilimesiale ligia, kiwigaafia kalugaaba mela. Auba ligia, hilia sunia, Saminilone dabalu mololabia abiamo, amone wasigalabia daaba melale. Dabalu, gili Saminilofea kulifia ligia, hogoloba molofe amo, balu moloba weaseyobafaleba hilisemale.<verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="s">Yelusalame idele inolo sagoba ufiyone mole dibia gagaiyomaleba solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 15:25-26">Lom 15.25-26</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 8:1-9">2Kld 8.1-9</ref></char>
    </note>Aga gilihe Godene <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">muuba kalilu idele inolo</char> Yelusalame kakainabu amone sagoba ufiyone, mole halaguba gagaiyofia, ilifea meyobafe amone, na gilifea asigi sawaba domesi saeyobasu. Nahe Galasia <char style="w">sese</char> idele inolofea molomaleluguba, gilida aubasu molomalesu. <verse eid="1CO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />Domo hilia sunia, gili ule ulebahe, sogo alegalu aleba ami, halagia meyodolu amone osolafasia, mole haisi amo dibia gagaiyofia, samolo seba homale. Ausenaga, na-da goafeiyamo, gilihe molemo ami haiba gagaiyoyone dabalu male miliyobafe. <verse eid="1CO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />Auba molosiamo, gilihe inolo noolohe gine ulu kegele amo dufia Yelusalame ugi dia malesi, iminiba waalemale. Na goasiamo, eloba babiyo sowi noolo selefasia, inolo gilihe iminilu ili ogo, meyone moleda, sowi selelu amoda sesaifia, Yelusalame ugi malaleyobasu. Ilihe ugi goasia, sowi eloba bamesine walefasia, mole gili gine hameselu mana amofea alefasia, ulu melu amo, sigidubulu idele inolo ami kakainabu amofea meba ilogoyobafe. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />Nada ugi maiyo adesenaga, ili ogo nadai ua maiyo.<verse eid="1CO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folo e Kolidi alebaibia maiyo hilisefe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 19:21">HD 19.21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Na Masedonia idele inolo ilida babiyo asigifegulu, na <char style="w">Masedonia</char> amidale daafia, dufiamo gili labeamo ami miyo. <verse eid="1CO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:24">Lom 15.24</ref></char></note>Na hilisesiamo, na gilidai fogo aso labeofia miyoba hilisesu. Na gilidai sigiamo, waagi labi, fufulo kolelu badi gi amo samodoyobafebile. Na gilidai aube osoloa amogulu labeofia, na gili afasia, haiba hele nolobalo maiyonemo, gili na sagoba homaleyobile? <verse eid="1CO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />Fogo alolufealo anogo, na gili labea mulumo, na nolobalo maiyone daaba ligia, gilidai hilia fogo abobosu alolu. Aga, <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilohe</char> waagi fogo mesenaga, na auba abobo miliyo hilisesiale, aga na gilidai hilia fogo selale miliyo hilisefe. <verse eid="1CO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" />Auluso, na <char style="w">Fedikoso Sigilo Hilia</char> waagi yasisia, Efesa dauno yaagi aso miliyobasu. <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:8-10">HD 19.8-10</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 2:12">2Kld 2.12</ref></char></note>Maumo, Godehe na dabalu iwi helegeba molomesimo, eno bule sogoba ofeleso. Auba labimo, inolo noolo nafeada habosia gisa diaba labe, ilida iwi wedinale alebaibu.<verse eid="1CO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 4:17">1Kld 4.17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="w" lemma="Dimodi">Dimodi</char> gili labea saabimo, e-mo gili baaba sagililosi, e heafuba luba dimale. Enebamo, na Saminilone dabalu mololabia daaba loluguba, Dimodi eda auba mololabia daaba labe. <verse eid="1CO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 4:12">1Dim 4.12</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, gili aleba ami, ulenohe e-mo baaba ilogofia, efea golaba bamabiyo. Aubale. Gilihe edai gadaeaba hamedofa ligia, e na labea obegeba milesine sagoba homale. Enebamo, nada, sigidubulu nelewodali na galiba alebaibu ili amoda, nini e milesi yasisu.<verse eid="1CO 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 3:6">1Kld 3.6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, nine nelewo Aboloso amone saaba sulu solu ulenoda selesu. Nahe efea, elewodali noolo galiba gili labea malaleluso, e aga aso maiyo hamefale kolebaso. Dufia e fogo adesenaga, e gili labea miyobafeso.<verse eid="1CO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sulu nooloda saeyo dobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />Gili enogele melale. <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">Asigi ule ufulufea</char> asidalu melale. Gili sagilifia gigilimesiale kiwigaafia melale. <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />Kegele sunia hameselo manafea alefasia molomale.<verse eid="1CO 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 1:16">1Kld 1.16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, ne damenedali, kegele no. <char style="w">Akaea</char> helea gilida kakainabia ami, idele inolo maugaba asigi besilu amone sebe sulu olaibo amo, Sedefanase ene damene amo ili koleba. Aufia, ili amohe, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Godene muuba kalilu idele inolo</char> sagoba ofelesiamo, dabalu koleba mololu. Aulugulu, nahe sulu eweguba gilifea koleba selesu. <verse eid="1CO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16" />Gili koleba, gine meleba idele inolo ewegulu amone sisa ofelesia, Godene dabaluda molofe ili amone sisa melale. <verse eid="1CO 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />Sedefanasedai, Fodunadusudai, Akaeakusudai, inolo ili osoloa ewe na labea goasimo, na henelu bule alolu. Maumo, gili moloyodoluale amomo, ili mololu. <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" />Enebamo, ilihe ne asubaneda, gine asubaneda, kiwigaaba ufulu. Aulugulu, gilihe inolo aubada molofe amone wi digimale.<verse eid="1CO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:2">HD 18.2</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 18:18">18</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 18:26">26</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="w">Sese</char> idele inolo Asia helea iwi kakainabu ili amohe, gilifea hawiyoba seleso. Akiwilada, Fulisilada, sese idele inolo aine moloa gagaiyolo ili amoda, Saminilone wi alefasia, gilifea hawiyoba seleso. <verse eid="1CO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />Damenedali iwi kakainabu amo suniahe gilifea hawiyoba seleso. Gili gine geleba heneba wakalisiamo, muuba kaliba mimiba wakalimale.<verse eid="1CO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />Na <char style="w">Folo</char>, nene sonehe seleba ofelesia, gilifea <char style="sig">Hawiyoba</char> seleba ofelesu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Folohe sowi selelu amo, ene sone koleba selelale. Aubale. E sulu mofeyo selaba labi, inolo none sone alefasia, sulu e selefe amo selelu. Auluso, aga iwimo, Folo ene sone alefasia, sulu noolo selelu. Ausi, sowi eweda alegafe amohe, eweguba eloba bamesine aulu. Sulu sowi ewene usu selelu dobu amo, Folone asigifeafia selelubiyo. Sulu amo inolo none asigifeafia muluba hiliselosine, ehe ene sone imini auba ufulu.</char></note><verse eid="1CO 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 1:8-9">Gal 1.8-9</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:20">MUU 22.20</ref></char>
    </note>Idele inolo abehe, Saminilofea hamesesalenaga, ili waagi Godene kanolo sisa melasia, ninidai melabusia aiisu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 16:22">Saminilo-ooo! Mila-aaa!<verse eid="1CO 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />Saminilo Yesune <char style="w" lemma="Kanululo">kanululomo</char> gilidai miliyobafe.<verse eid="1CO 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />Nini ua Keliso Yesufea kulifia lolugulu, na gili suniafea hamesefia lolu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 16:24">
    <figure style="fig" alt="End of book bilas" file="EndOfBookOnobasulu_Epistles.tiff" size="span" loc="End of Book" ref="16.24" /><verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>